Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.55,0:02:19.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz Lightyear mission log.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.01,0:02:23.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,All signs point to this planet as the location of Zurg's fortress,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:26.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,but there seems to be no sign of intelligent life anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:26.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come to me, my prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.19,0:04:12.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,To infinity and beyond!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.37,0:04:24.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, we meet again, Buzz Lightyear, for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.90,0:04:27.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, we meet again, Buzz Lightyear, for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.84,0:04:30.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not today, Zurg!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.36,0:04:51.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,You almost had him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.33,0:04:53.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm never gonna defeat Zurg! - Sure, you will, Rex...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.03,0:04:55.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,In fact, you're a better Buzz than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:57.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,But look at my little arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:05:01.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't press the "fire" button and jump at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:03.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where is it? Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.51,0:05:07.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody? - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:12.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang on, cowboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:18.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody, are you all right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.89,0:05:22.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine, Buzz. OK. Here's your list of things to do while I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.76,0:05:24.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Batteries need to be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:26.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Toys in the bottom of the chest need to be rotated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:28.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,And make sure everyone attends Mr. Spell's seminar...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:30.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,on what to do if you or a part of you is swallowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.70,0:05:32.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK? OK. Good. OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.34,0:05:34.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody, you haven't found your hat yet, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.57,0:05:36.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,And Andy's leaving for cowboy camp any minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.04,0:05:38.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,and I can't find it anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.34,0:05:40.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Woody. In just a few hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:45.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,you'll be sitting around a campfire with Andy making delicious, hot "sch'moes."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:48.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- They're called s'mores, Buzz. - Right. Right. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:50.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Has anyone found Woody's hat yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:54.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep looking, men. Dig deeper! Negatory. Still searching.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.23,0:05:58.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,The lawn gnome next door says it's not in the yard, but he'll keep lookin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.77,0:06:03.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not in Molly's room. We've looked everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.77,0:06:05.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I found it. - You found my hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:08.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your hat? No. The missus lost her earring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:12.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- My little sweet potato! - You found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:14.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's so nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:18.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,to have a big, strong spud around the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.92,0:06:21.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:24.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,This'll be the first year I miss cowboy camp, all because of my stupid hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:26.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody, look under your boot. - Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:29.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,- My hat is not under my boot. - Would you just look?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:33.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,No hat. Just the word "Andy".
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:35.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,And the boy who wrote that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:38.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,would take you to camp with or without your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.77,0:06:41.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Bo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.81,0:06:44.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just that I've been lookin' forward to this all year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.64,0:06:46.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's my one time with just me and Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:48.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're cute when you care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:53.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Bo, not in front of Buzz. - Let him look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.49,0:06:56.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Miss Peep, your sheep!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:01.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is Al from Al's Toy Barn
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.26,0:07:02.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,and I'm sittin' on good deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.73,0:07:05.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think I'm feeling a deal hatching right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:09.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's see what we got. We got boats for a buck Beanies for a buck...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.64,0:07:12.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Turn it off! Someone's gonna hear! - Which one is off?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:15.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buck-buck-buck! And that's cheap-cheap-cheap! So hurry on down...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:17.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,For cryin' out loud, it's this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.84,0:07:21.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I despise that chicken. - Fellas! Fellas!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:25.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, I got some good news, and I got some bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.12,0:07:26.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,What news?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:28.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,The good news is I found your hat, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.99,0:07:32.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,My hat! Slink, thank you. Thank you, thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:35.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where'd you find it? - Well, that's the bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.00,0:07:38.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.66,0:07:40.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Canine alert! Man your battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.03,0:07:43.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:45.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody! Hide! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:10.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, OK, OK. OK, OK! You found me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.33,0:08:13.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buster, all right. Hey, how did he do, Hamm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.37,0:08:17.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Looks like a new record. - OK, boy. Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:19.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:22.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.94,0:08:24.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great job, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:27.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna miss me while I'm gone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:28.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.71,0:08:30.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.85,0:08:32.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy, you got all your stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:34.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have a good weekend, everybody. I'll see you Sunday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.19,0:08:36.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.86,0:08:40.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stick 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.36,0:08:43.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll work on that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:45.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Woody. Ready to go to cowboy camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.93,0:08:49.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy, honey, come on. Five minutes, and we're leavin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.77,0:08:52.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.04,0:08:55.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help, help! Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:08:57.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let her go, evil Dr. Pork Chop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.54,0:08:59.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:02.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,You must choose, Sheriff Woody. How shall she die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.11,0:09:06.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shark, or death by monkeys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:09.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Choose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:10.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,I choose Buzz Lightyear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:13.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? That's not a choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.73,0:09:16.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,To infinity and beyond!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.76,0:09:20.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'll save you, Miss Peep. - My hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.07,0:09:24.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Thanks, Buzz. - No problem, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:26.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,You should never tangle with the unstoppable duo
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.97,0:09:28.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,of Woody and Buzz Lightyear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:32.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.68,0:09:35.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy, let's go! Molly's already in her car seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:39.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- But, Mom, Woody's arm ripped. - Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:43.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Maybe we can fix. Him on the way. - No, just leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.59,0:09:48.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, honey, but you know toys don't last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.81,0:10:02.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What happened? - Woody's been shelved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:11.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:34.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody? - Woody? Honey, are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:55.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ride 'em, cowboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:59.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's back? Hey, everybody! Andy's back! He's back early from cowboy camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:01.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Places, everybody! Andy's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.97,0:11:11.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Woody! Did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.14,0:11:14.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Giddyap, giddyap, giddyap. Ride 'em, cowboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.95,0:11:18.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,I forgot. You're broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:23.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna play with you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:45.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Andy! No. No, Andy! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.38,0:11:48.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy. Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:51.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bye, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.15,0:11:54.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! No! Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:10.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wheezy, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:12.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Woody. - What are you doing up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:16.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought Mom took you to get your squeaker fix. Ed months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.07,0:12:18.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Andy was so upset. - Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.28,0:12:20.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,She just told him that to calm him down
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.61,0:12:22.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,and then put me on the shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:26.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Why didn't you yell for help? - Well, I tried squeakin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.22,0:12:28.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I'm still broken. No one could hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:35.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Besides, the dust aggravates my condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.83,0:12:42.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the point in prolonging the inevitable?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.87,0:12:47.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're all just one stitch away from here to there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.34,0:12:51.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yard sale? Yard sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.21,0:12:54.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yard sale! Guys, wake up, wake up! There's a yard sale outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:57.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yard sale? - Sarge, emergency roll call!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.48,0:12:59.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir! Red alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.65,0:13:03.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,All civilians fall in position now! Single file! Let's move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:04.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hamm? - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.92,0:13:06.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Potato Head, Mr. And Mrs? - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.52,0:13:08.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Troikas. Check, check, check, check, check.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.36,0:13:10.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hate yard sales!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.43,0:13:13.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.47,0:13:18.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK. Let's see what's up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.65,0:13:38.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bye, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:47.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wheezy! Think, think, Woody. Think, think, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.17,0:13:52.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. Here, boy. Here, Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.67,0:13:54.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.51,0:13:56.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,No...No...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.38,0:13:59.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, boy. To the yard sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.78,0:14:01.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's goin' on? He's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:02.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,His arm ain't that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.01,0:14:05.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Woody! We love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:07.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Careful on the steps, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.33,0:14:26.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, boy. Let's go. And keep it casual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.18,0:14:36.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not that casual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:40.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Piggy bank coming through, coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.85,0:14:44.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is he out there? - There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.50,0:14:55.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's in the box!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.17,0:14:57.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's sellin' himself for 25 cents!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.47,0:14:58.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're worth more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.07,0:15:01.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Hold on. He's got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.41,0:15:03.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's Wheezy! - Wheezy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:06.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's not suicide. It's a rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.35,0:15:13.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good boy, Buster. Hold still. There. There you go, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:15.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Bless you, Woody. - All right, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:17.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Back to Andy's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.59,0:15:20.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Way to go, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.76,0:15:24.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Golly bob howdy! - Woody, I'm slipping!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.10,0:15:33.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mommy... Mommy, look! Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.64,0:15:37.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mommy, look! It's a cowboy dolly! - Hey, that's not her toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.11,0:15:39.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's that little gal think she's doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:42.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mommy, Mommy, can we get it? Please? Mommy, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:44.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't want that toy. It's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.35,0:15:46.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a snake in my boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.09,0:15:55.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Original hand-painted face. Natural-dyed, blanket-stitched vest!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.19,0:16:00.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Little rip. Fix. Able. If only you had your hand-stitched, polyvinyl...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:04.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,A hat! I found him! I found him! I found him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:08.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buster! Quiet down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.24,0:16:09.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ex. Cuse me. Can I help you? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.04,0:16:12.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can help take his paws off my pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:14.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll give you 50 cents for all this junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.01,0:16:17.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Now, how did this get down here? - Hand her the sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:20.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.12,0:16:23.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Five dollars. - I'm sorry. It's an old family toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.29,0:16:24.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now just walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.49,0:16:26.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wait. - The other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:29.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'll give you 50 bucks for him. - Fifty bucks ain't bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:31.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's not for sale. - Everything's for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.03,0:16:35.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Or trade. You like my watch? - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:38.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He's safe. Way to go! - She showed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.70,0:16:43.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Molly, don't touch that, sweetie. - Yeah. Go home, Mr. Fancy Car.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.28,0:16:46.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hold on. - What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.24,0:16:48.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it, Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.81,0:16:50.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.88,0:16:51.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.98,0:16:54.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't watch! Can someone cover my eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.02,0:16:57.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He's stealin' Woody! - What? He can't take Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.45,0:16:58.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.86,0:17:00.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where's he going? - Do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:02.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.63,0:17:04.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get him, Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:09.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's the red jacket?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:46.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why would someone steal Woody?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.44,0:18:27.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Let's review this one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:30.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,At precisely 8:32-ish,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.21,0:18:33.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ex. Hibit A, Woody, was kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.18,0:18:36.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ex. Hibit B, a composite sketch of the kidnapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.29,0:18:41.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He didn't have a beard like that. - Fine. Etch, give him a shave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:43.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,The kidnapper was bigger than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.99,0:18:46.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Picky, picky, picky. - Let's just go straight to Ex. Hibit F.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:48.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,The kidnapper's vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.33,0:18:50.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, the vehicle fled the scene in this direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.77,0:18:52.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your eyes are in backwards. It went the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.87,0:18:53.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. Put a cork in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.97,0:18:56.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How do you spell FBI? - My crime scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.47,0:18:58.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you watch where you're going, Godspilla?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.81,0:19:01.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I didn't know there was a crime scene. - Ex. Cuse me. Ex. Cuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.48,0:19:03.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,A little quiet, please. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.12,0:19:10.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lazy toy brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.52,0:19:15.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Lousy try Brian. - What are you doing, Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:17.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's some sort of message encoded on that vehicle's I.D. Tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.99,0:19:19.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Liz try bran. - It's just a license plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.06,0:19:21.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's just a jumble of letters. - Yeah, and there are about
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.96,0:19:25.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,3.5 million registered cars in the tri-county area alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.77,0:19:28.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lou's thigh burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:32.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,This can't help. Let's leave Buzz to play with his toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.68,0:19:36.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Toy. Toy. Toy. Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.95,0:19:42.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Al's Toy Barn. - Al's Toy Barn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:46.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Etch, draw that man in a chicken suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.76,0:19:51.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the chicken man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.93,0:19:53.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's our guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.43,0:19:56.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I knew there was something I didn't like about that chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.63,0:19:58.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah. I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.70,0:20:01.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,And we're gonna do this commercial in one take, do you hear me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.27,0:20:04.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,because I am in the middle of something really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:11.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,You, my little cowboy friend, are gonna make me big buck-buck-bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.51,0:20:42.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:49.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I have to drive all the way to work on a Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.45,0:20:50.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,All the way to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.44,0:21:11.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.21,0:21:18.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop! Horsy, stop! Stop! Sit, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.92,0:21:22.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Sit, I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.29,0:21:32.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's you! It's you! It's you! It's you! It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:35.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's really you! - What's me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:39.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a snake in my boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.64,0:21:41.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It is you! - Please stop saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.64,0:21:44.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Prospector said someday you'd come.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.14,0:21:46.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sweet mother of Abraham Lincoln!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:49.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Prospector! He'll wanna meet ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.49,0:21:59.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Say "hello" to the Prospector!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.99,0:22:03.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It... It's a box... - He's mint in the box...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.79,0:22:05.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Never been opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.76,0:22:09.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Turn me around, Bullseye, so I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.10,0:22:15.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why, the prodigal son has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.31,0:22:18.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's you! It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:21.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're here! It's you! It's you! It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.44,0:22:24.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK. I'm officially freaked-out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.08,0:22:28.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've waited countless years for this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.58,0:22:31.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's good to see you, Woody. - Listen. I don't know wh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.89,0:22:36.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, how do you know my name? - Everyone knows your name, Wood-y.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.89,0:22:43.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why, you don't know who you are, do you? Bullseye?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.98,0:23:01.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.91,0:23:25.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.41,0:23:31.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Holy cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.15,0:23:38.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cowboy Crunchies
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.65,0:23:41.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,the cereal that's sugar-frosted and dipped in chocolate
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.19,0:23:42.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,proudly presents:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.83,0:23:46.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody's Roundup Come on it's time to play
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.83,0:23:48.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's Jessie the yodeling cowgirl
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.03,0:23:51.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look it! That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.97,0:23:55.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Bullseye he's Woody's horse - He's a smart one
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.77,0:23:59.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Pete the old Prospector - Has anyone seen my pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.01,0:24:03.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,And the man himself Of course it's time for Sheriff Woody
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.48,0:24:04.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's the very best
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.98,0:24:07.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's the rootin'-est tootin'-est cowboy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.55,0:24:10.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,In the wild wild west
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.39,0:24:14.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody's Roundup
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.23,0:24:19.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't find it! It doesn't seem to be on any of these stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.36,0:24:21.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Keep looking. - You're going too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.26,0:24:22.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me take the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.87,0:24:25.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.47,0:24:27.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How can you even tell what's on? - I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.34,0:24:30.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop! Back, back, back!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.91,0:24:34.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Too late. I'm in the 40s. Got to go 'round the horn. It's faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.44,0:24:37.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Back, back! Stop! - And look for the giant chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.41,0:24:40.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, Etch!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.22,0:24:43.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's where I need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.72,0:24:45.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't go, Buzz. You'll never make it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.82,0:24:48.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody once risked his life to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.16,0:24:52.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,I couldn't call myself his friend if I weren't willing to do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.33,0:24:54.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,So who's with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.33,0:25:00.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm packing you an extra pair of shoes and your angry eyes just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.04,0:25:04.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is for Woody when you find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.08,0:25:09.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.31,0:25:11.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I don't think it'll mean the same coming from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.68,0:25:16.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Buzz Lightyear, you just gotta save my pal Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.75,0:25:19.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.72,0:25:22.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, fellas. Let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.23,0:25:30.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Geronimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.77,0:25:34.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'd think with all my video game ex. Perience,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.34,0:25:36.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd be feeling more prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.01,0:25:41.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,The idea is to let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.88,0:25:44.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll be back before Andy gets home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.58,0:25:47.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to any toy you don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.92,0:25:51.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,To Al's Toy Barn and beyond!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.67,0:26:04.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,They don't call this
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.00,0:26:06.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,the old abandoned mine for nothin' Prospector.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.80,0:26:08.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,I reckon we oughta get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.87,0:26:12.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's my gold? Hold on. I'll light me a candle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.24,0:26:14.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,This sure is a fast-burnin' wick.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.41,0:26:17.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Blast us to smithereens! That there's dynamite!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.85,0:26:19.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Holy tarnation! - I'll call for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.45,0:26:26.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey critters go get Sheriff Woody. Now scurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.56,0:26:28.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good job Bullseye.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.36,0:26:30.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I reckon the new schoolhouse is finally done.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.46,0:26:32.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.70,0:26:35.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jessie and Prospector are trapped in the old abandoned mine
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.16,0:26:37.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,and Prospectorjust lit a stick of dynamite thinkin' it was a candle
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.40,0:26:39.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,and now they're about to be blown to smithereens?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.44,0:26:43.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ride like the wind Bullseye!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.44,0:26:50.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're fannin' the flames Jessie! It takes brains to put out that fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.31,0:26:52.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,My biscuits are burnin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.22,0:27:00.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Will Woody and Bullseye land to safety?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.72,0:27:03.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can they reach Jessie and Stinky Pete in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.33,0:27:07.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tune in net week for the eciting conclusion: "Woody's Finest Hour."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.20,0:27:10.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right! All right! Next tape!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.47,0:27:13.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait. What happened? What happens next?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.14,0:27:15.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on! Let's see the next episode! - That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.57,0:27:16.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.64,0:27:19.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,The show was canceled after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.98,0:27:22.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait. What about the gold mine
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.14,0:27:24.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,and the cute little critters and the dynamite?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.75,0:27:27.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,That was a great show! I mean, why cancel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.58,0:27:30.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two words: Sput-nik.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.09,0:27:35.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Once the astronauts went up, children only wanted to play with space toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.09,0:27:38.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know how that feels. But still, my own show.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.76,0:27:41.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I mean, look at all this stuff! - Didn't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.20,0:27:44.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why, you're valuable property!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.17,0:27:47.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wish the guys could see this. Hey-howdy-hey. That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.20,0:27:48.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm on a yo-yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.31,0:27:54.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice teeth. And yet, still a good-lookin' guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.65,0:28:00.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a bank! Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.22,0:28:03.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you do? You push the hat, and out co...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.22,0:28:06.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Out come bubbles. Clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.96,0:28:09.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow. What's this thing do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.86,0:28:12.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.63,0:28:14.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,"There's a snake in my boot."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.90,0:28:19.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Bullseye. Go long! Go long!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.47,0:28:22.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,A record player!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.01,0:28:27.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen one of these in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.31,0:28:29.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, now. Slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.01,0:28:32.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's funny, Bullseye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.98,0:28:35.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hop on, cowgirl! Think fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.52,0:28:41.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Not bad. - It's time for Woody's Roundup
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.22,0:28:43.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's the very best
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.69,0:28:46.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's the rootin'-est tootin'-est cowboy...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.90,0:28:50.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at us! We're a complete set!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.60,0:28:53.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Now it's on to the museum. - Museum?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.97,0:28:57.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What museum? - The museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.04,0:29:02.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're being sold to the Konishi Toy Museum in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.14,0:29:04.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's in japan! - Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.41,0:29:07.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no. I can't go to japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.02,0:29:09.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.52,0:29:11.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've got to get back home to my owner, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.72,0:29:13.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, look. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.26,0:29:16.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He still has an owner. - My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.99,0:29:19.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. Can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.70,0:29:22.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't do storage again. I just can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.73,0:29:24.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Jessie. - I won't go back in the dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.87,0:29:26.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? What's wrong with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.80,0:29:29.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, we've been in storage for a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.44,0:29:31.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.54,0:29:33.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Why me? - The museum's
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.44,0:29:36.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,only interested in the collection if you're in it, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.61,0:29:39.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Without you, we go back into storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.98,0:29:42.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's that simple. - It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.72,0:29:44.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,How can you do this to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.52,0:29:47.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, look. I'm sorry, but this is all a big mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.59,0:29:50.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You see, I was in this yard sale... - Yard sale?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.73,0:29:52.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why were you in a yard sale if you have an owner?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.00,0:29:55.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I wasn't supposed to be there. I was trying to save another toy when...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.97,0:29:59.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Was it because you're damaged? Did this Andy break you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.70,0:30:03.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but... No, no, no, no, no! It was... It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.67,0:30:06.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I mean... - Sounds like he really loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.38,0:30:10.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not like that, OK? And I'm not going to any museum!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.38,0:30:12.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not going back into storage!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.62,0:30:16.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Al's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.35,0:30:17.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go! Go on, jessie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.99,0:30:19.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jessie, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.42,0:30:23.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,I promise you'll come out of the box... Now go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.13,0:30:32.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's show time!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.37,0:30:36.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Money, baby. Money, money, money.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.67,0:30:41.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,And now, the main attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.54,0:30:55.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! His arm! Where's his arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.75,0:30:58.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,No...No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.15,0:31:01.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do? I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.92,0:31:05.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on! Come on! Pick up the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.42,0:31:07.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hello? - It's me. It's Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.32,0:31:08.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.39,0:31:10.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm busy. - Yes, we're all busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.23,0:31:12.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look. It has to be tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.06,0:31:15.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. All right. But first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.76,0:31:18.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's gone! I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.43,0:31:21.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,- My arm is completely gone! - All right. Come here. Let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.14,0:31:24.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just a popped seam, easily repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.51,0:31:26.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You should consider yourself lucky. - Lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.94,0:31:29.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you shrink-wrapped? I am missing my arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.01,0:31:32.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.68,0:31:36.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let him go. I'm sure his precious Andy
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.05,0:31:40.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,is dying to play with a one-armed cowboy doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.22,0:31:44.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why, jessie, you know he wouldn't last an hour on the streets in his condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.49,0:31:48.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a dangerous world out there for a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.59,0:32:13.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Nobody look till I get my cork back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.59,0:32:16.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good work, men. Two blocks down and only 19 more to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.83,0:32:18.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - Nineteen?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.23,0:32:20.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are we gonna do this all night? My parts are killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.00,0:32:22.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.23,0:32:25.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did Woody give up when Sid had me strapped to a rocket?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.07,0:32:30.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,And did he give up when you threw him out of the back of that moving van?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.34,0:32:32.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You had to bring that up. - No, he didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.84,0:32:37.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have a friend in need, and we will not rest until he's safe in Andy's room!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.08,0:32:39.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now let's move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.75,0:32:48.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,And that concludes our broadcast day.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.33,0:33:36.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bullseye. Bullseye, go, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.64,0:33:38.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. You don't wanna help me. I'm the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.97,0:33:42.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're gonna go back in storage because of me, remember? Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.74,0:33:45.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bullseye... All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.71,0:33:50.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you have got to keep quiet. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.72,0:33:58.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Over here. Attaboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.53,0:34:01.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, Bullseye. Upsy-daisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.58,0:34:17.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bullseye. Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.01,0:34:20.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop it. Stop it, Bullseye. Stop it. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.92,0:34:23.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.45,0:34:54.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody's Roundup Come on it's time to play
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.42,0:35:01.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Officer! I swear. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.80,0:35:11.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get in there. There you go. Cheap case.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.43,0:35:16.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where is the remote? Where is the remote?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.77,0:35:20.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't I put it in the same place every... Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.99,0:35:33.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.32,0:35:35.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm sorry I can't help you guys out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.36,0:35:38.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Really, I am. But you didn't have to go and pull a stunt like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.13,0:35:40.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? You think I did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.76,0:35:42.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right. The TV just happened to turn on,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.93,0:35:45.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,and the remote magically ended up in front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.37,0:35:48.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You calling me a liar? - Well, if the boot fits...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.30,0:35:50.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Say that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.50,0:35:53.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,If the boot fits.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.91,0:35:56.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.85,0:36:06.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,How do you like that? Take it back! Take it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.19,0:36:08.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't think just 'cause you're a girl, I'm gonna take it easy on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.76,0:36:11.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jessie, Woody, you stop this at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.56,0:36:16.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know how that television turned on,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.96,0:36:19.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,but fighting about it isn't helping anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.30,0:36:22.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,- If I had both my arms... - The fact is, you don't, Woody,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.64,0:36:25.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,so I suggest you just wait until morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.11,0:36:28.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The cleaner will come, fix. Your arm... - And then I'm outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.08,0:36:34.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no. Bullseye, don't take it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.32,0:36:36.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's just that Andy... - Andy, Andy, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.45,0:36:39.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's all he ever talks about.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.66,0:36:50.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buzz, can we slow down?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.76,0:36:54.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,May I remind you that some of us are carrying over six. Dollars in change?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.70,0:36:57.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Losing health units. Must rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.87,0:37:01.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is everyone present and accounted for? - Not quite everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.11,0:37:03.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Who's behind? - Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.65,0:37:11.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys. Why do the toys cross the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.29,0:37:14.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Not now, Hamm. - I love riddles. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.32,0:37:17.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,To get to the chicken on the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.59,0:37:21.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,The chicken!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.83,0:37:28.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, well. We tried. - We'll have to cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.44,0:37:29.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.77,0:37:31.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not turning me into a mashed potato.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.84,0:37:36.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,I may not be a smart dog, but I know what roadkill is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.21,0:37:38.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,There must be a safe way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.22,0:37:45.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK. Here's our chance. Ready. Set. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.66,0:37:56.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.04,0:38:04.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.84,0:38:08.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Drop! I said "drop"!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.54,0:38:11.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.29,0:38:21.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.30,0:38:30.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.29,0:38:57.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,That went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.40,0:39:06.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good job, troops. We're that much closer to Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.07,0:39:13.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.21,0:39:16.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is the specimen ready for cleaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.51,0:39:49.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,So how long is this gonna take?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.74,0:39:53.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't rush art.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.46,0:40:09.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. It's closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.03,0:40:13.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're not preschool toys, Slinky. We can read.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.64,0:40:20.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, joe, you're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.07,0:40:21.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've got a ton of toys to unload.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.67,0:40:23.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. All right. I'm comin'. I'm comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.01,0:40:25.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.78,0:40:29.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,But the sign says it's closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.42,0:40:34.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no. All together. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.51,0:40:58.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Nelly! How are we going to find Woody in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.74,0:41:02.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look for Al. We find Al, we find Woody. Now move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.78,0:41:06.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody? - Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.22,0:42:17.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.46,0:42:20.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's for display only.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.73,0:42:23.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,You handle him too much, he's not gonna last.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.33,0:42:26.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's amazing. You're a genius. He's just like new.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.15,0:42:50.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.40,0:43:04.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,I could use one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.40,0:43:06.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I could use one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.28,0:43:21.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, they make it so you can't defeat Zurg unless you buy this book.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.89,0:43:23.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's extortion. That's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.86,0:43:26.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, I always thought the golden sector was the only...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.29,0:43:30.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought we could search in style.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.60,0:43:34.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice going there, Hamm. So how about letting a toy with fingers drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.54,0:43:46.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Am I really that fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.55,0:43:56.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing? - You're in direct violation
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.42,0:43:58.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,of Code 6404.5,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.26,0:44:00.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,stating all space rangers are to be in hyper-sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.06,0:44:03.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,until awakened by authorized personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.33,0:44:04.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.36,0:44:06.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're breakin' ranks, ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.43,0:44:09.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz Lightyear to Star Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.17,0:44:12.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I've got an AWOL space ranger. - Tell me I wasn't this deluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.90,0:44:16.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,No back talk! I have a laser, and I will use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.74,0:44:19.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,You mean the laser that's a light bulb?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.34,0:44:23.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Has your mind been melded? You could've killed me, space ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.05,0:44:26.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or should I say "traitor"?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.62,0:44:29.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't have time for this. - Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.39,0:44:31.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I order you to halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.06,0:44:41.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen to me. Listen. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.53,0:44:44.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We've been down this aisle already. - We've never been down this aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.47,0:44:47.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's pink. - Face it. We're lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.81,0:44:49.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Back it up. Back it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.54,0:44:55.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,What a great party!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.08,0:44:59.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,How low can you go? How low can you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.69,0:45:03.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ex. Cuse me, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.15,0:45:06.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Does anyone know where we might find the Al of Al's Toy Barn?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.09,0:45:09.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.23,0:45:11.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm Tour Guide Barbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.66,0:45:14.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please keep your hands, arms and accessories inside the car,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.63,0:45:16.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,and no flash photography.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.54,0:45:19.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Thank you. - I'm a married spud. I'm a married spud.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.67,0:45:22.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then make room for the single fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.97,0:45:26.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,To our right is the Hot Wheels aisle. Developed in 1967,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.18,0:45:28.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,the original series had 16 cars, including the Corvette.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.81,0:45:30.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon, ma'am, but where's Al's office?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.98,0:45:34.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please hold all questions until the end of the tour. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.15,0:45:36.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,It says how you defeat Zurg! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.45,0:45:39.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Excuse me, sir. - Get this outta here, "geek-osaur."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.32,0:45:42.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Look out! - Stop, stop, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.97,0:45:50.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Turn into the spin, Barbie!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.40,0:45:54.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,My source of power!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.11,0:45:57.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Come back! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.94,0:46:01.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait up! Hey! Come on! Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.68,0:46:04.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dinosaur overboard! Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.45,0:46:07.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Remain seated, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.06,0:46:13.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen to me. Listen to me. You're not really a space ranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.93,0:46:16.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a toy. We're all toys. Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.90,0:46:19.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, that should hold you till the court martial.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.63,0:46:23.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me go! You don't realize what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.57,0:46:26.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,And this is the Buzz Lightyear aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.34,0:46:31.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,In 1995, shortsighted retailers did not order enough dolls to meet demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.41,0:46:33.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Buzz! - Halt! Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.91,0:46:36.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quit clownin' around and get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.62,0:46:38.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, Buzz, I know how to defeat Zurg!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.92,0:46:42.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You do? - Come on. I'll tell you on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.25,0:46:47.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, guys! You've got the wrong Buzz! You've got the wrong Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.83,0:46:50.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Say, where'd you get the cool belt, Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.20,0:46:52.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, slotted pig, they're standard issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.68,0:47:08.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's like printing my own money.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.28,0:47:10.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.72,0:47:15.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Konishi. Yes, I have the pictures right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.52,0:47:19.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,In fact, I'm in the car right now on my way to the office to fax. Them to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.92,0:47:22.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going through a tunnel! I'm breakin' up!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.96,0:47:26.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow! Will you look at me? It's like I'm fresh out of the box!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.73,0:47:30.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at this stitching! Andy's gonna have a hard time rippin' this! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.00,0:47:33.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.24,0:47:35.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great. Now you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.38,0:47:41.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, what a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.22,0:47:52.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody, don't be mad at jessie.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.86,0:47:55.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's been through more than you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.16,0:47:57.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why not make amends before you leave, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.73,0:48:00.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the least you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.24,0:48:11.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. But I don't know what good it'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.15,0:48:20.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey. Whatcha doin' way up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.72,0:48:25.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thought I'd get one last look at the sun before I get packed away again.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.73,0:48:29.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, jessie. I know you hate me for leaving,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.13,0:48:31.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I have to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.70,0:48:34.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm still Andy's toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.53,0:48:37.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, if you knew him, you'd understand. Andy's a real...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.54,0:48:41.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me guess. Andy's a real special kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.24,0:48:43.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,And to him, you're his buddy, his best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.74,0:48:49.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,And when Andy plays with you, it's like even though you're not moving,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.41,0:48:53.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,you feel like you're alive, because that's how he sees you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.49,0:48:55.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,How did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.75,0:48:59.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because Emily was just the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.16,0:49:01.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,She was my whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.76,0:49:07.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,When somebody loved me
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.87,0:49:11.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything was beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.17,0:49:14.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Every hour we spent together
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.04,0:49:18.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lives within my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.18,0:49:22.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,And when she was sad
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.38,0:49:25.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was there to dry her tears
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.02,0:49:31.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,And when she was happy so was I
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.66,0:49:36.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,When she loved me
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.80,0:49:43.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Through the summer and the fall
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.17,0:49:47.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,We had each other That was all
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.44,0:49:50.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just she and I together
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.54,0:49:55.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like it was meant to be
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.11,0:49:58.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,And when she was lonely
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.52,0:50:02.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was there to comfort her
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.12,0:50:05.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I knew that
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.62,0:50:11.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,She loved me
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.30,0:50:21.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,So the years went by
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.24,0:50:23.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,I stayed the same
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.94,0:50:27.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,But she began to drift away
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.88,0:50:31.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was left alone
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.02,0:50:35.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Still I waited for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.12,0:50:37.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,When she'd say
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.89,0:50:41.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will always
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.63,0:50:45.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Love you
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.23,0:50:50.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lonely and forgotten
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.30,0:50:53.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I never thought she'd look my way
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.84,0:50:57.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,She smiled at me and held me
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.54,0:51:01.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just like she used to do
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.65,0:51:05.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like she loved me
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.35,0:51:09.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,When she loved me
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.82,0:51:14.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,When somebody loved me
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.16,0:51:18.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything was beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.06,0:51:23.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Every hour we spent together
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.10,0:51:27.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lives within my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.07,0:51:33.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,When she loved me
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.79,0:51:51.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,You never forget kids like Emily or Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.33,0:51:55.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,But they forget you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.07,0:51:59.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Jessie, I... I didn't know. - Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.46,0:52:23.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,How long will it last, Woody?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.23,0:52:26.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you really think Andy is gonna take you to college
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.83,0:52:28.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,or on his honeymoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.67,0:52:32.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy's growing up,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.80,0:52:35.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,and there's nothing you can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.01,0:52:39.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's your choice, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.14,0:52:43.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can go back, or you can stay with us and last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.35,0:52:48.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll be adored by children for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.37,0:53:08.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who am I to break up the Roundup gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.09,0:53:27.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Woody, are you in here? - Nah. This one's empty too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.56,0:53:30.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody! Woody! - Woody!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.43,0:53:33.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, gentlemen, but have either of you seen a cowboy doll with a bad arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.06,0:53:36.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Why, no, I haven't. - Hey! He was talkin' to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.43,0:53:38.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No! He was talkin' to me! - Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.64,0:53:41.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,You see, all along,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.70,0:53:44.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,we thought the way into Zurg's fortress was through the main gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.44,0:53:49.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,but in fact, the secret entrance is to the left, hidden in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.35,0:53:51.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,To the left in the shadows. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.98,0:53:55.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Someone's coming. - Everyone, take cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.99,0:53:58.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was a big pile-up, but I don't want to bore you with the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.52,0:54:00.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes. Now, let me confirm your fax. Number.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.89,0:54:02.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.23,0:54:03.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a lot of numbers. No. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.96,0:54:06.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's him. - The chicken man.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.23,0:54:07.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Funny, he doesn't look like poultry.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.56,0:54:10.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the kidnapper, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.40,0:54:13.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,A kidnapper! An agent of Zurg if I ever saw one.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.08,0:54:24.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,And the piece de resistance!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.01,0:54:27.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I promise the collection will be the crown jewel of your museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.85,0:54:30.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's Woody! - Now that I have your attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.35,0:54:33.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,imagine we added another zero to the price, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.26,0:54:38.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'll pay anything you want. - Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.33,0:54:41.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got a deal! I'll be on the next flight to japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.13,0:54:43.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quick. Into the poultry man's cargo unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.27,0:54:46.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,He'll lead us to Zurg. Move, move, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.24,0:54:49.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't touch my moustache!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.31,0:54:58.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rich, rich, rich, rich!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.79,0:56:15.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Destroy Buzz Lightyear.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.03,0:56:19.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Destroy Buzz Lightyear. Destroy Buzz Lightyear.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.10,0:56:27.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He didn't take the bag! - No time to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.95,0:56:39.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's ascending in the vertical transporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.22,0:56:42.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone. Hang on. We're gonna blast through the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.55,0:56:46.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Buzz? - To infinity and beyond!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.49,0:56:53.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you? Insane? We're wasting time. Stand still, Godzilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.96,0:56:56.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.20,0:56:58.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Somehow my fuel cells have gone dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.39,0:57:18.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Blast. He's on level 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.59,0:57:20.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,How are we gonna get up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.99,0:57:23.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we find some balloons, we could float to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.53,0:57:26.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding? I say we stack ourselves up,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.26,0:57:28.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,push the intercom and pretend we're delivering a pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.80,0:57:32.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,How about a ham sandwich... with fries and a hot dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.17,0:57:33.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.24,0:57:34.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can be the toy that comes with the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.07,0:57:37.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Troops! Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.51,0:57:44.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just like you said, lizard man. "In the shadows to the left."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.95,0:57:48.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK. Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.28,0:57:51.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mission log. Have infiltrated enemy territory without detection
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.72,0:57:54.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,and are making our way through the bowels of Zurg's fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.52,0:57:58.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, I think that Buzz aisle went to his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.13,0:58:00.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Which way do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.06,0:58:03.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- This way! - What makes you so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.20,0:58:06.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm Buzz Lightyear. I'm always sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.07,0:58:10.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've been detected. The walls! They're closing in! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.11,0:58:12.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help me prop up vegetable man, or we're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.58,0:58:14.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Put me down, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.68,0:58:17.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys, look! It's not the walls! It's the elevator!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.29,0:58:28.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. We've got no time to lose. Everyone, grab hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.19,0:58:30.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.26,0:58:33.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, why not just take the elevator?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.26,0:58:35.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,They'll be ex. Pecting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.41,0:58:51.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buzz! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.98,0:58:54.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.92,0:58:57.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,To overnight six. Packages to japan is how much?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.29,0:59:00.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? That's in yen, right? - No dollars sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.59,0:59:01.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Dollars? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.06,0:59:06.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are deliberately taking advantage of people in a hurry, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.23,0:59:09.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll do it! All right. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.30,0:59:12.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll have the stuff in the lobby, and you'd better be here in 15 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.60,0:59:15.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,because I have a plane to catch, do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.97,0:59:20.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're finally going. Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.68,0:59:25.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's custom-fitted foam insulation you'll be riding in, Bullseye.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.08,0:59:27.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,First class all the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.38,0:59:31.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what? I'm actually ex. Cited about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.19,0:59:33.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean it. I really am!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.29,0:59:34.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,And why shouldn't you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.09,0:59:38.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Swing your partner do-si-do
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.23,0:59:42.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Look at you, dancing cowboy! - Look! I'm doin' the box. Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.34,0:59:55.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, heads up down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.24,1:00:00.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Pork bellies are fallin'. - Hey, how much farther, Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.22,1:00:03.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Halfway there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.29,1:00:06.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,My arms can't hold on much longer!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.63,1:00:12.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Too... heavy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.00,1:00:14.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.86,1:00:17.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,My antigravity servos!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.83,1:00:21.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang tight, everyone. I'm going to let go of the wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.47,1:00:22.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - He wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.07,1:00:24.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,- One... - He would.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.97,1:00:27.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.28,1:00:28.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Three!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.81,1:00:36.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,To infinity and beyond!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.02,1:00:40.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Approaching destination. Reengaging gravity.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.33,1:00:52.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Area secure.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.10,1:00:53.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's OK, troops.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.17,1:00:58.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,The antigravity sickness will wear off momentarily. Now let's move!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.21,1:01:01.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Remind me to glue his helmet shut when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.19,1:01:13.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,How 'bout givin' me a little intro there, jessie?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.19,1:01:16.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Introducing the high-ridin'-est cowboy around...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.53,1:01:17.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,You forgot "rootin'-tootin'-est"!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.93,1:01:22.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,The high-ridin'-est, rootin'-tootin'-est cowboy hero of all time,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.87,1:01:24.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sheriff Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.74,1:01:37.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Say, little missy, you notice any trouble around these parts?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.27,1:01:40.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nary a bit, not with Sheriff Woody around.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.20,1:01:42.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait-wait-wait! I got it! This is great! OK!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.27,1:01:44.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,The bandits got the critters tied up in the burning barn. Now the best part!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.77,1:01:46.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help us! The barn's on fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.98,1:01:49.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've got ya, critters. No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.45,1:01:51.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody saves the day again!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.61,1:01:54.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, where's my trusty steed Bullseye?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.88,1:01:57.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have to ride off into the sunset...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.62,1:02:01.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ride like the wind, Bullseye!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.43,1:02:07.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Watch it. Wait. I'm ticklish, OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.96,1:02:09.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you are?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.87,1:02:12.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no. Cut it out. Stop it. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.13,1:02:14.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, please. No, no. Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.95,1:02:26.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mission log. Have reached Zurg's command deck,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.68,1:02:29.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,but no sign of him or his wooden captive.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.45,1:02:31.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Please, no! - That's Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.82,1:02:34.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.43,1:02:38.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please, please, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.46,1:02:40.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, can you see? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.97,1:02:45.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Take that! - To the left.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.20,1:02:46.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, your left.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.84,1:02:48.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Take it up higher. - What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.97,1:02:52.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's horrible. They're torturing him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.11,1:02:55.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are we gonna do, Buzz? - Use your head!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.48,1:02:58.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I don't wanna use my head!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.05,1:03:05.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.52,1:03:07.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, guys! Hey, how did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.72,1:03:08.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Watch yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.92,1:03:10.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're here to spring ya, Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.56,1:03:12.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,You heard of kung fu?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.69,1:03:14.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, get ready for pork chop.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.40,1:03:19.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Prepare to meet Mr. Angry Eyes!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.64,1:03:22.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold it, now! Hey, you don't understand! These are my friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.84,1:03:26.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, we're his friends! - No, Rex, I mean they're my friends!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.11,1:03:29.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it! You leave him alone, springy dog!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.18,1:03:32.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Grab Woody, and let's go! - Fellas, hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.28,1:03:34.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Buzz, put me down! - Quick! To the vent!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.82,1:03:37.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,- They're stealing him! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.39,1:03:39.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.86,1:03:41.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Buzz? - You again?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.86,1:03:43.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody! Thank goodness you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.19,1:03:44.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, what is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.73,1:03:48.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on. I am Buzz Lightyear, and I'm in charge of this detachment.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.40,1:03:49.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I'm Buzz Lightyear.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.87,1:03:51.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm Buzz Lightyear! - I'm Buzz Lightyear!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.23,1:03:53.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, who's the real Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.44,1:03:54.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I am! - I am!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.50,1:03:55.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't let this impostor fool you!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.04,1:03:59.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's been trained by Zurg himself to mimic my every move.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.42,1:04:07.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.48,1:04:08.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I had a feelin' it was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.02,1:04:12.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,My front end just had to catch up with my back end.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.02,1:04:15.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Will somebody please ex. Plain what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.42,1:04:18.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's all right, space ranger. It's a code 546.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.59,1:04:21.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You mean it's a... - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.30,1:04:23.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And he's a... - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.23,1:04:27.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.64,1:04:29.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody, you're in danger here. We need to leave now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.84,1:04:32.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Al's selling you to a museum in japan!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.44,1:04:36.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know. It's OK, Buzz. I actually wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.71,1:04:38.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.41,1:04:41.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, the thing is, I'm a rare Sheriff Woody doll,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.38,1:04:44.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,and these guys are my Roundup gang.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.32,1:04:47.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you talking about? - Woody's Roundup!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.42,1:04:51.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's this great old TV show, and I was the star. See? Now look.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.09,1:04:53.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look! Look at me! See? That's me!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.50,1:04:56.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- This is weirdin' me out. - Buzz, it was a national phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.07,1:05:00.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,There was all this merchandise that got packed up. You should have seen it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.50,1:05:03.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,There was a record player and a yo-yo. Buzz, I was a yo-yo!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.47,1:05:06.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,- "Was"? - Stop this nonsense and let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.64,1:05:07.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.98,1:05:13.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't go. I can't abandon these guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.42,1:05:15.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,They need me to get into this museum.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.82,1:05:19.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Without me, they'll go back into storage. Maybe forever!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.59,1:05:23.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody, you're not a collector's item. You're a child's plaything.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.63,1:05:26.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are a toy!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.23,1:05:29.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,For how much longer? One more rip, and Andy's done with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.90,1:05:32.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,And what do I do then, Buzz? Huh? You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.33,1:05:35.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Somewhere in that pad of stuffing is a toy who taught me
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.77,1:05:38.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,that life's only worth living if you're bein' loved by a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.91,1:05:42.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I traveled all this way to rescue that toy
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.48,1:05:44.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,because I believed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.48,1:05:48.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, you wasted your time.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.42,1:05:56.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let's go, everyone. - What about Woody?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.19,1:05:59.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's not coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.53,1:06:03.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,But... But Andy's coming home tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.80,1:06:06.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then we'd better make sure we're there waiting for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.35,1:06:20.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't have a choice, Buzz. This is my only chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.28,1:06:25.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,To do what, Woody? Watch kids from behind glass and never be loved again?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.19,1:06:27.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Some life.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.76,1:06:34.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is everybody OK? - Sheriff Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.33,1:06:37.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I knew you'd make it! - Now remember deputies
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.90,1:06:40.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,the real treasures are your friends and family.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.67,1:06:44.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Before I go kids I want to share somethin' special with you
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.31,1:06:46.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,- for the times I'm not around. - Good going, Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.04,1:06:48.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought they'd never leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.74,1:06:51.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've got a friend in me
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.15,1:06:53.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've got a friend in me
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.22,1:06:57.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody? - You've got troubles
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.22,1:07:00.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well I've got 'em too
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.12,1:07:04.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,There isn't anything I wouldn't do for you
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.23,1:07:07.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,We stick together and see it through
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.20,1:07:10.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,'Cause you've got a friend in me
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.43,1:07:16.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Some other folks might be a little bit smarter than I am
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.07,1:07:18.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bigger and stronger too
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.61,1:07:20.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.48,1:07:24.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,But none of them will ever love you
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.18,1:07:26.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,The way I do
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.08,1:07:28.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's me and you boy
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.82,1:07:31.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,And as the years go by
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.05,1:07:36.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our friendship will never die
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.86,1:07:40.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What am I doing? - You're gonna see it's our destiny
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.73,1:07:43.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Buzz! Wait! Wait! - Woody, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.87,1:07:47.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're right, Prospector. I can't stop Andy from growing up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.37,1:07:49.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I wouldn't miss it for the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.77,1:07:51.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No! - Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.97,1:07:53.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes? - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.64,1:07:55.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.11,1:07:58.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait... wait... wait. I'll be back in just a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.38,1:08:00.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Way to go, cowboy!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.45,1:08:04.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, you guys... Come with me. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.09,1:08:06.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy will play with all of us. I know it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.32,1:08:08.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody, I... I... I don't know. I...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.49,1:08:12.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you give anything just to have one more day with Emily?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.23,1:08:16.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, jessie. This is what it's all about: To make a child happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.67,1:08:19.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you know it. Bullseye, are you with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.84,1:08:22.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, good boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.84,1:08:24.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Prospector, how 'bout you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.84,1:08:31.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Prospector? - You're outta your box!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.85,1:08:35.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,I tried reasoning with you, Woody,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.18,1:08:38.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,but you keep forcing me to take extreme measures.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.36,1:08:43.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. You turned on the TV last night, not jessie.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.89,1:08:47.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, we have an eternity to spend together in the museum.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.53,1:08:50.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's not start off by pointing fingers, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.33,1:08:52.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,You really are Stinky Pete, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.57,1:08:53.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Prospector, this isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.04,1:08:57.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Fair"? I'll tell you what's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.64,1:09:03.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Spending a lifetime on a dime-store shelf watching every other toy be sold.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.21,1:09:05.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, finally my waiting has paid off,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.51,1:09:10.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,and no hand-me-down cowboy doll is gonna mess it up for me now!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.22,1:09:14.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz. Help, Buzz! Guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.96,1:09:19.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's too late, Woody. That silly Buzz Lightweight can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.13,1:09:21.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,His name is Buzz Lightyear.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.43,1:09:25.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whatever. I've always hated those upstart space toys.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.77,1:09:28.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's stuck! What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.24,1:09:30.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Should I use my head?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.01,1:09:33.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Al!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.24,1:09:37.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at the time. I'm gonna be late!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.91,1:09:40.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Figures. I can't miss this flight! I've gotta pack.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.15,1:09:42.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Let's see. Wallet, keys, tickets,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.45,1:09:45.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,passport, beef jerky, very ex. Pensive over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.42,1:09:48.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shower! I can skip the shower.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.19,1:09:52.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just gotta get outta here now!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.23,1:09:54.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quick! To the elevator!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.30,1:10:01.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry. I can hear it coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.78,1:10:09.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, we meet again, Buzz Lightyear,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.78,1:10:11.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.48,1:10:15.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Zurg! Watch out! He's got an ion blaster!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.56,1:10:32.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quick! Get on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.64,1:10:37.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,The emergency hatch! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.83,1:11:01.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on! Hurry! - But Buzz is in peril!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.30,1:11:04.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz... Buzz... Buzz... Lightyear to the rescue!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.01,1:11:17.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Surrender, Buzz Lightyear. I have won.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.95,1:11:20.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll never give in. You killed my father!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.92,1:11:25.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Buzz. I am your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.19,1:11:28.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.06,1:11:32.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.83,1:11:39.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, you could have defeated Zurg all along!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.80,1:11:42.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,You just need to believe in yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.80,1:11:46.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Prepare to die! - I can't look!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.38,1:11:58.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,I did it. I finally defeated Zurg!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.42,1:11:59.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.16,1:12:09.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.25,1:12:36.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,How are we gonna get him now?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.16,1:12:38.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pizza, anyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.16,1:12:42.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Go, go, go! - I got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.20,1:12:43.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, are you coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.33,1:12:47.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I have a lot of catching up to do with my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.37,1:12:52.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good throw, son. That's my boy. Go long, Buzzy!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.47,1:12:56.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're a great dad. - Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.44,1:12:58.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Does anyone know how to drive?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.28,1:13:00.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Slink, take the pedals. Rex, you navigate.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.68,1:13:03.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hamm and Potato, operate the levers and knobs.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.29,1:13:10.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Strangers. - From the outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.12,1:13:13.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no. - He's at a red light! We can catch him!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.36,1:13:14.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Max. Imum power, Slink!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.86,1:13:19.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,It turned green! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.30,1:13:21.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Why won't it go? - Use the Wand of Power.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.11,1:13:32.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Rex, which way? - Left! No, no! I mean right!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.51,1:13:35.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's right! No, I mean left! Left is right!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.58,1:13:40.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, he's turning left! He's turning left!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.69,1:13:42.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.02,1:13:47.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I seriously doubt he's gettin' this kind of mileage.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.63,1:13:50.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go right! To the right! Right-right-right-right!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.83,1:13:57.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have saved our lives. We are eternally grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.54,1:13:59.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.25,1:14:11.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,The white zone is for immediate loading and unloading...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.42,1:14:14.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,No parking.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.56,1:14:19.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys, we can't park here! It's a white zone!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.19,1:14:22.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have saved our lives. We are eternally grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.26,1:14:24.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Final boarding call... - There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.23,1:14:26.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,... for Far East Airlines flight 451 to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.93,1:14:31.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,All confirmed passengers must board at this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.14,1:14:36.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Passenger Twitch passenger Leon Twitch please pick up...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.14,1:14:38.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have saved our lives. We are eternally grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.98,1:14:41.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Will you leave me alone? - Someone's coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.55,1:14:44.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- A puppy! - Bark-bark-bark-bark.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.28,1:14:46.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bark-bark-bark-bark-bark.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.85,1:14:47.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen, flyboy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.92,1:14:50.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,The contents of that case are worth more than you make in a year!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.92,1:14:53.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You got that? You be careful! - I understand, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.39,1:14:55.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you have a "fragile" sticker or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.83,1:14:58.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I had a box. Of cookies once that came back as crumbs!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.67,1:15:01.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Mystic Portal!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.73,1:15:06.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Once we go through, we just need to find that case.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.02,1:15:23.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- There's the case! - No, there's the case!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.39,1:15:26.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,You take that one! We'll take this one!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.14,1:15:43.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, my back end's goin' to Baton Rouge!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.04,1:15:45.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Slinky!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.65,1:15:50.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here we come, Woody! Woody, here we come! Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.45,1:15:52.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice flash though.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.66,1:16:08.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK, Woody, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.70,1:16:11.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take that, space toy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.47,1:16:14.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! No one does that to my friend!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.61,1:16:22.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your choice, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.68,1:16:25.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can go to japan together or in pieces.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.55,1:16:28.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,If he fix. Ed ya once, he can fix. Ya again. Now get in the box!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.06,1:16:31.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Never! - Fine!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.70,1:16:39.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No! - Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.77,1:16:42.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Idiots! Children destroy toys!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.30,1:16:44.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll all be ruined, forgotten!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.74,1:16:47.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Spending eternity rotting in some landfill!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.64,1:16:52.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, Stinky Pete, I think it's time you learned the true meaning of playtime.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.91,1:16:57.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Right over there, guys! - No. No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.25,1:17:02.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Atlantic Air flight 810 from Point Richmond
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.09,1:17:04.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,now arriving at Gate 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.09,1:17:07.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, Barbie. A big ugly man doll.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.23,1:17:09.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,He needs a makeover.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.86,1:17:15.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi! You'll like Amy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.37,1:17:17.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's an artist!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.07,1:17:22.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, hon!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.14,1:17:26.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Happy trails, Prospector.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.21,1:17:28.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Buzz! Woody! - Help us out here!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.95,1:17:30.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.12,1:17:33.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no. Jessie! Come on! - Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.63,1:17:44.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jessie!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.80,1:17:47.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.30,1:17:49.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ride like the wind, Bullseye!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.85,1:18:01.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey-howdy-hey! Giddyap!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.81,1:18:04.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Bullseye!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.49,1:18:09.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, give me a boost!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.10,1:18:19.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.07,1:18:54.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here's the rest!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.52,1:19:18.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ex. Cuse me, ma'am, but I believe you're on the wrong flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.82,1:19:20.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody! - Come on, jess.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.93,1:19:22.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's time to take you home.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.76,1:19:25.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- But what if Andy doesn't like me? - Nonsense! Andy'll love you!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.07,1:19:29.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Besides, he's got a little sister. - He does?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.40,1:19:32.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.64,1:19:39.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold it! There's a couple more bags coming from the terminal!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.41,1:19:41.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK. On three.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.41,1:19:43.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- One, two... - Too late!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.78,1:19:46.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Put 'em on the next flight!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.16,1:19:55.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- This is bad. - How are we gonna get outta here?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.30,1:19:59.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Over there! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.58,1:20:15.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You sure about this? - No! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.94,1:20:37.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.24,1:20:45.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's a cowboy without his hat? - Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.43,1:21:02.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz! Buzz, get behind the tires!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.60,1:21:09.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jessie, let go of the plane!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.97,1:21:11.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.40,1:21:14.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just pretend it's the final episode of Woody's Roundup.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.57,1:21:18.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,But it was canceled! We never saw if you made it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.14,1:21:20.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, then, let's find out together!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.69,1:21:37.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,We did it! We did it! We did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.23,1:21:38.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice ropin', cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.80,1:21:41.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,That was definitely Woody's finest hour!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.70,1:21:44.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your hat, partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.01,1:21:52.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's... go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.13,1:22:10.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Woody! Woody?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.57,1:22:18.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow! New toys!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.80,1:22:20.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cool! Thanks, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.67,1:22:25.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Bazooka jane and her jet-propelled horse!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.01,1:22:29.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody, Buzz, that polecat Zurg has stolen my space cows
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.38,1:22:32.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,and they're headed for the asteroid!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.39,1:22:40.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy, come on, hon. Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.06,1:22:43.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, you fix. Ed Woody! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.86,1:22:47.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Glad I decided not to take him to camp. His whole arm might have come off.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.67,1:22:55.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.88,1:23:02.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bullseye, we're part of a family again!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.59,1:23:09.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.19,1:23:11.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanted to say you're a bright young woman
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.39,1:23:13.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,with a beautiful "yarnful" of hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.33,1:23:16.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Hairful" of yarn. It's...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.23,1:23:17.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,I must go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.43,1:23:21.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you the sweetest space toy I ever met?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.80,1:23:25.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's that? Bark-bark?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.00,1:23:29.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,This fella says he needs to go out for a little private time.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.44,1:23:31.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,That critter needs help!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.16,1:23:45.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rex, I could use a hand over here, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.26,1:23:48.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't need to play. I've lived it!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.73,1:23:50.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, nuts!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.73,1:23:52.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Al's Toy Barn.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.97,1:23:55.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've got the lowest prices in town.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.90,1:24:00.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything for a buck-buck-buck.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.34,1:24:03.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess crime doesn't pay.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.81,1:24:07.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy did a great job, huh? Nice and strong!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.18,1:24:10.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I like it. Makes you look... tough.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.92,1:24:15.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have saved our lives. We are eternally grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.42,1:24:19.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,You saved their lives? My hero!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.36,1:24:22.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,And they're so adorable! Let's adopt them!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.90,1:24:24.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.23,1:24:25.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.70,1:24:29.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wheezy, you're fix. Ed!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.07,1:24:33.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Mr. Shark looked in the toy box. And found me an extra squeaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.51,1:24:36.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And... how do you feel? - I feel swell.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.81,1:24:41.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,In fact, I think I feel a song comin' on.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.18,1:24:46.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've got a friend in me
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.72,1:24:51.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've got a friend in me
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.59,1:24:54.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,You just remember what your old pal said
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.39,1:24:57.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Babe you've got a friend in me
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.00,1:25:00.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah you've got a friend in me
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.93,1:25:04.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on over. You are such a big girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.44,1:25:06.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy, you think she's ready to drive the car yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.64,1:25:08.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I can teach her.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.57,1:25:11.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You still worried? - About Andy?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.54,1:25:15.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, it'll be fun while it lasts. - I'm proud of you, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.91,1:25:21.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Besides, when it all ends, I'll have old Buzz Lightyear to keep me company...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.12,1:25:23.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,...for infinity and beyond.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.09,1:25:24.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,...for infinity and beyond.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.46,1:25:28.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're gonna see it's our destiny
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.03,1:25:30.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You've got a friend in me - Yes you do
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.90,1:25:33.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You've got a friend in me - Yes you do
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.43,1:25:36.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You've got a friend in me - That's the truth
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.07,1:25:40.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've got a friend
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.24,1:25:43.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,In me
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.44,1:25:45.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,In me
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.61,1:25:47.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.35,0:01:21.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,《玩具总动员2》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:28.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,(伽玛象限  第四区域)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.55,0:02:19.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年任务日志
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.01,0:02:23.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有的迹象都显示,这就是札克天王的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:26.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是却没有,智慧形生物的踪影
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.25,0:03:00.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,(太空骑警巴斯光年)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.48,0:03:24.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,(札克天王监视器)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:26.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,自投罗网吧,我的猎物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.33,0:03:47.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,(札克天王能量库)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.19,0:04:12.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞向宇宙…浩瀚无垠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.93,0:04:19.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,(札克天王能量库)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.37,0:04:24.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们又见面了,巴斯光年,这次你死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.90,0:04:27.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们又见面了,巴斯光年,这次你死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.84,0:04:30.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你休想,札克
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.86,0:04:48.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,(游戏结束)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.36,0:04:51.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,不…不…,你差点就打败他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.33,0:04:53.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我永远都赢不了札克 - 你会赢的,抱抱龙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.03,0:04:55.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你当巴斯比我还要厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:57.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的手太短了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:05:01.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能同时按发射和跳跃的按键
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:03.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,在哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.51,0:05:07.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡迪 - 嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:12.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,别慌,牛仔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:18.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.89,0:05:22.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没事啦,巴斯,我不在的时候别忘了这些事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.76,0:05:24.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,记得要换电池
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:26.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,让柜底的玩具出来透透气
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:28.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家都要上拼字先生的课
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:30.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,“玩具被吞食该如何应变”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.70,0:05:32.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吗?很好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.34,0:05:34.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还没找到帽子,对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.57,0:05:36.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,对,安弟要参加牛仔营
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.04,0:05:38.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我却找不到牛仔帽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.34,0:05:40.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心,再过几个钟头
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:45.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就能跟安弟坐在营火旁,一起烤香喷喷的马铃薯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:48.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是蕃薯啦,巴斯 - 没错,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:50.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁找到胡迪的帽子吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:54.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,弟兄们,继续找报告,我们还在找
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.23,0:05:58.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,前院小矮人说不在院子里,但是他会继续找
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.77,0:06:03.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们到处都找过了,不在茉莉房间
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.77,0:06:05.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我找到了 - 你找到我的帽子?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:08.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的帽子?不是啦,我老婆丢了耳环
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:12.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我的亲亲蛋头太太 - 你找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:14.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,家里有个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:18.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,强壮的蛋头老公真好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.92,0:06:21.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,这下可好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:24.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去不成牛仔营,都是因为一顶蠢帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:26.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡迪,看看你的靴底 - 别傻了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:29.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 帽子不在那儿 - 你看看嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:33.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,瞧,没有帽子,只有“安弟”这两个字
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:35.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管你有没有帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:38.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,他还是会带你去牛仔营
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.77,0:06:41.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起,宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.81,0:06:44.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是我等了一整年
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.64,0:06:46.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,才能单独跟安弟相处
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:48.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这样好可爱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:53.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别在巴斯面前这样嘛 - 他爱看就看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.49,0:06:56.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,宝贝小姐,你的绵羊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:01.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是艾而玩具城的艾而
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.26,0:07:02.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿有便宜货
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.73,0:07:05.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,好东西正要破卵而出
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:09.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我看看有什么,我有一块钱的玩具船、豆娃娃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.64,0:07:12.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快关掉,有人会听到 - 怎么关呀?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:15.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,价钱低得咕咕叫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:17.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,是这个按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.84,0:07:21.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我最恨那只鸡 - 大伙儿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:25.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有好消息跟坏消息
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.12,0:07:26.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,快说吧,什么消息?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:28.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,好消息是我找到你的帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.99,0:07:32.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的帽子,弹簧狗,谢谢你…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:35.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你在哪儿找到的? - 这就是坏消息
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.00,0:07:38.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,是小狗巴斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.66,0:07:40.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,恶犬来袭!全面备战!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.03,0:07:43.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,快行动!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:45.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,快躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:10.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啦…好啦…你找到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.33,0:08:13.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,夠了,巴斯特,火腿,它的表现如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.37,0:08:17.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 它又刷新纪录 - 乖,狗狗,坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:19.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,把手举起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:22.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.94,0:08:24.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,好棒哦,狗狗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:27.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我走了谁会想我?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:28.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁会想我?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.71,0:08:30.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁会想我呀?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.85,0:08:32.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟,你的袋子呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:34.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,大伙儿周末愉快,礼拜天见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.19,0:08:36.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,在我的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.86,0:08:40.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,手举起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.36,0:08:43.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我改天再教你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:45.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,准备去牛仔营啰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.93,0:08:49.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟,快点,五分钟后出发
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.77,0:08:52.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.04,0:08:55.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,救命啊!谁来救我?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:08:57.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,邪恶的猪排博士,放开她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.54,0:08:59.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:02.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你得选择,胡迪警长,你要她怎么死?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.11,0:09:06.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,鲨鱼?还是被猴子吃掉?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:09.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,快选择吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:10.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我选择巴斯光年
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.06,0:09:11.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,(星际总部)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:13.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,那可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.73,0:09:16.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞向宇宙…浩瀚无垠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.76,0:09:20.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我来救你,宝贝小姐 - 我的大英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.07,0:09:24.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谢了,巴斯 - 不客气,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:26.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,千万别惹上所向无敌的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.97,0:09:28.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,…胡迪和巴斯光年
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:32.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.68,0:09:35.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟,走了,妹妹都上车了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:39.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 妈咪,胡迪的手被扯破了 - 糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:43.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 也许可以在路上补好 - 不要,别带去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.59,0:09:48.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,别难过,乖乖,玩具没有永远不坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.26,0:09:49.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,(三星级牛仔营)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.81,0:10:02.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事? - 胡迪被放到架子上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:11.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.12,0:10:16.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,(小狗岛)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:19.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,(超大卡车)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:34.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡迪? - 胡迪,帅哥,你还好吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:55.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,咿呀,快骑吧,牛仔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:59.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,他回来了?他回来了,安弟从牛仔营提早回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:01.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,各就各位,安弟来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.97,0:11:11.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,你想我吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.14,0:11:14.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,跑吧…马儿,快骑吧,牛仔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.95,0:11:18.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我忘了,你坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:23.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不要跟你玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.53,0:11:30.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,(安弟)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:45.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,安弟,不!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.38,0:11:48.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟,安弟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.08,0:11:51.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,永别了,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.15,0:11:54.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟,别走!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:10.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,吱吱,是你吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:12.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嗨,胡迪 - 你怎么会在这儿?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:16.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以为妈咪,老早就把你修好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.07,0:12:18.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 安弟很着急耶 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.28,0:12:20.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,她只是安慰安弟而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.61,0:12:22.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后就把我放上来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:26.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么不求救呢? - 我试着吱吱叫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.22,0:12:28.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,可是没有用,没有人听得到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:35.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,况且灰尘让我病得更重
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.83,0:12:42.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,反正我是无药可救了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.87,0:12:47.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们最后都会沦落到那儿的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.34,0:12:51.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,前院拍卖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.21,0:12:54.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,前院拍卖!大伙儿,醒醒,外面在拍卖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:57.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 前院拍卖? - 队长,紧急点名
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.48,0:12:59.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,是,长官,紧急状况
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.65,0:13:03.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,马上全体集合,排成一列,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.89,0:13:04.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 火腿 - 在这
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.92,0:13:06.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 蛋头先生、太太 - 在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.52,0:13:08.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,蛋包蛋,在在在在在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.36,0:13:10.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我最讨厌大拍卖
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.43,0:13:13.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.47,0:13:18.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,让我看看有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:29.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,(组合玩具)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.65,0:13:38.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,永别了,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:47.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,吱吱,快点,胡迪,快想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.17,0:13:52.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,狗狗,我在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.67,0:13:54.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.51,0:13:56.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,不…不…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.38,0:13:59.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,快到前院
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.78,0:14:01.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?他秀逗了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:02.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的手没那么糟嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.01,0:14:05.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,别去找死,我们爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:07.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,下楼梯小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.33,0:14:26.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧,狗狗,要装得若无其事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.18,0:14:36.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是装腔作势啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:40.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,火腿大爷来也
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.85,0:14:44.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他在外面吗? - 他在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.80,0:14:53.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,(两毛五)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.50,0:14:55.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,他爬进箱子了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.17,0:14:57.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,他只把自己标价两毛五
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.47,0:14:58.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,你没这么不值钱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.07,0:15:01.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,他找到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.41,0:15:03.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是吱吱 - 吱吱?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:06.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不是自杀,他是去救人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.35,0:15:13.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,乖狗狗,别乱动,来吧,好兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.35,0:15:15.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你真好,胡迪 - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:17.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,回安弟房间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.59,0:15:20.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,干得好,牛仔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.76,0:15:24.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真是了不起 - 胡迪,我快掉下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.10,0:15:33.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈咪,你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.64,0:15:37.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你看,是一个牛仔娃娃 - 胡迪不是她的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.11,0:15:39.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个小女孩想干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:42.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈咪,卖啦,好不好?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:44.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,乖乖,不要啦,它坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.35,0:15:46.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的靴子里有蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.09,0:15:55.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,原版手工上漆,天然染色、锁边背心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.19,0:16:00.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,有点破,能补救,希望有你的手缝尼龙布制…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:04.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,…牛仔帽,我找到了,我找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:08.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯特,安静
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.24,0:16:09.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉,我能帮忙吗? - 当然能
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.04,0:16:12.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,叫他别碰我的好友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:14.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我出五毛钱卖这个破玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.01,0:16:17.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这怎么会在这儿? - 乖乖的把警长…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.82,0:16:20.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,…交给她
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.12,0:16:23.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 五块钱 - 抱歉,这是家里的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.29,0:16:24.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,乖乖给我走开
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.49,0:16:26.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 另外一边
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:29.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我出五十块钱 - 五十元不少钱耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:31.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不卖 - 什么都能卖卖或交易
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.03,0:16:35.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喜欢我的表吗? - 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:38.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他得救了,安弟的妈咪万岁 - 棒呆了,她让他吃瘪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.70,0:16:43.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 茉莉,别乱摸 - 滚回家吧,胖子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.28,0:16:46.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.24,0:16:48.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.81,0:16:50.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,发生什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.88,0:16:51.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,他在干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.98,0:16:54.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不敢看,矇住我的眼睛,好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.02,0:16:57.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他想要偷走胡迪 - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.45,0:16:58.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是犯法的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.86,0:17:00.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他去哪儿? - 想想办法呀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:02.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.63,0:17:04.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,阻止他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.56,0:17:09.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,红色夹克在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:15.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,(要卖请早)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.89,0:17:32.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,(三郡车牌)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:46.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么会有人要偷走胡迪呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:20.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,(儿童不宜进入)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:23.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,(证物A)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.44,0:18:24.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,(证物A)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.44,0:18:27.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们再回顾一次
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:30.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,8时32分左右
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.21,0:18:33.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,证物A胡迪遭到绑架
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.18,0:18:36.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,证物B绑匪的素描
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.29,0:18:41.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他的胡子没那么长 - 好吧,画板,帮他刮胡子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:43.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,绑匪比较胖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.99,0:18:46.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们真挑剔 - 直接跳到证物F
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:48.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,绑匪的车子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.33,0:18:50.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,他从这方向逃离现场
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.77,0:18:52.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的眼睛装反了,是另一边啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.87,0:18:53.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,别教训我,猪头
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.97,0:18:56.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,- FBI英文怎么拼呀? - 我的犯罪现场
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.47,0:18:58.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,瞎眼龙,走路要看路,好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.81,0:19:01.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我没看到犯罪现场 - 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.48,0:19:03.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,请安静点,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.12,0:19:10.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,懒骨头
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.52,0:19:15.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 逊角色 - 巴斯,你在干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:17.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,那辆车的车牌暗藏玄机
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.99,0:19:19.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 试试... - 车牌的字母没什么意义
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.06,0:19:21.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 只是一堆乱七八糟的信件 - 没错,本郡总共有...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.96,0:19:25.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,三百五十万辆汽车
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.77,0:19:28.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,没用的软脚虾
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:32.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有用啦,让巴斯继续玩玩具吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.68,0:19:36.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,玩具…等等!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.95,0:19:42.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 艾而玩具城 - 艾而玩具城!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:46.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,画板,画出扮成公鸡的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.76,0:19:51.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是那个公鸡人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.93,0:19:53.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,他就是嫌犯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.43,0:19:56.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我早就知道那只鸡有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.63,0:19:58.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啦,我马上来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.70,0:20:01.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,这次广告要一次搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.27,0:20:04.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我正在办一件正事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:11.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的小牛仔朋友,你会让我发大猜…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.51,0:20:42.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:49.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信,他们礼拜六竟然…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.45,0:20:50.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,…要我大老远开车跑去上班
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:55.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,(艾而玩具城)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.44,0:21:11.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.21,0:21:18.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,停!马儿,停!坐下来!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.92,0:21:22.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫你坐!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.29,0:21:32.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你…是你…是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:35.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真的是你! - 是我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:39.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的靴子里有蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.64,0:21:41.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就是你 - 请你别再说了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.64,0:21:44.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,老矿工就说有一天你会来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.14,0:21:46.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,乖乖老天爷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:49.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,老矿工一定很想见你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.49,0:21:59.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来跟老矿工问好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.49,0:21:59.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,(邋遢矿工彼得)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.99,0:22:03.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是个盒子 - 他是全新的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.79,0:22:05.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有拆封过
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.76,0:22:09.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,红心,把我转过来,让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.00,0:22:12.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,(胡迪牛仔秀系列玩具)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.10,0:22:15.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,浪子终于回头了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.31,0:22:18.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你,你来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:21.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你…是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.44,0:22:24.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真的被吓坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.08,0:22:28.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们等了多少年,才等到这一天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.58,0:22:31.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你,胡迪 - 听好,我不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.89,0:22:36.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道我的名字? - 你的名字家喻户晓,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.89,0:22:43.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不记得自己是谁吗?红心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:57.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,(胡迪牛仔秀)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.98,0:23:01.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是我耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.29,0:23:04.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,(牛仔牌玉米脆片  胡迪牛仔秀)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.75,0:23:05.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,(牛仔牌玉米脆片)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.02,0:23:08.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,(胡迪牛仔秀)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.91,0:23:25.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇赛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.41,0:23:29.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,(时代杂志  生活杂志)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.41,0:23:31.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,老天爷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.15,0:23:38.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,牛仔牌玉米脆片
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.65,0:23:41.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,唯一的巧克力口味壳类早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.19,0:23:42.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,热情赞助
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.83,0:23:46.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪牛仔秀,大家一起玩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.83,0:23:48.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是翠丝,唱歌女牛仔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.03,0:23:51.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,瞧,那是我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.97,0:23:55.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 红心,胡迪的好马儿 - 他真聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.77,0:23:59.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 邋遢矿工彼得 - 我的丁字鎚呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.01,0:24:03.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然还有男主角他本人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.48,0:24:04.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪警长他最行
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.98,0:24:07.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是西部
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.55,0:24:10.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,最棒最酷最炫的警长
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.39,0:24:14.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪牛仔秀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.09,0:24:14.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,(选台  音量)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.16,0:24:16.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,(选台  音量)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.23,0:24:19.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我找不到,每一台都找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.36,0:24:21.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 继续找 - 你转得太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.26,0:24:22.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.87,0:24:25.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.47,0:24:27.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么看得到? - 我看得到
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.34,0:24:30.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,转回去,回去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.91,0:24:34.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,太晚了,转过头了,我要从头开始
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.44,0:24:37.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对了 - 找到大公鸡就没错
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.41,0:24:40.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,画板,快画吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.22,0:24:43.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一定要去这里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.72,0:24:45.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行,巴斯,你办不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.82,0:24:48.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,上次胡迪冒险救我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.16,0:24:52.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,这次我不去救他,就不配当他的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.33,0:24:54.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁要跟来?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.33,0:25:00.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我替你多装一双鞋,还有愤怒的双眼,以防万一
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.04,0:25:04.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要你找到胡迪,替我亲他一下
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.08,0:25:09.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,可是我亲他
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.31,0:25:11.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟你亲他的意义很不同
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.68,0:25:16.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年先生,你一定要把胡迪救出来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.75,0:25:19.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会尽力而为,吱吱
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.72,0:25:22.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,大伙儿,出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.23,0:25:30.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跳了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.77,0:25:34.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有这么多打电玩的经验
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.34,0:25:36.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以应该是难不倒我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.01,0:25:41.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,重点是…你得放手
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.88,0:25:44.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会赶在安弟之前回来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.58,0:25:47.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,别随便跟陌生玩具说话
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.92,0:25:51.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞向艾而玩具城
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.67,0:26:04.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,老矿工
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.00,0:26:06.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,这座废弃矿坑真是可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.80,0:26:08.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们最好赶紧出去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.87,0:26:12.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的黄金呢?等等,我来点蜡烛
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.24,0:26:14.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,这根蜡烛烧得好快
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.41,0:26:17.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是炸药,我们完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.85,0:26:19.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我的妈呀 - 让我来求救
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.45,0:26:26.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,小动物,去找胡迪警长,快去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.56,0:26:28.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,真好,红心
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.36,0:26:30.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,新的学校终于盖好了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.46,0:26:32.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.70,0:26:35.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,翠丝和老矿工,被困在废弃矿坑
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.16,0:26:37.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,老矿工误触炸药
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.40,0:26:39.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们就快要被炸成碎片?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.44,0:26:43.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,红心,快马加鞭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.44,0:26:50.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,别煽风点火,翠丝,你得用头脑才能熄灭炸药
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.31,0:26:52.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的屁股着火了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.92,0:26:56.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,(大峡谷)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.22,0:27:00.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪跟红心能跃过大峡谷吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.72,0:27:03.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们能及时救出,翠丝跟老矿工彼得吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.33,0:27:07.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,下周同一时间记得收看《胡迪冒险记》大结局
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.20,0:27:10.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,棒呆了,下一集
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.47,0:27:13.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,接下来怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.14,0:27:15.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我要看大结局 - 没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.57,0:27:16.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.64,0:27:19.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,后来节目被迫停播
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.98,0:27:22.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,慢着,那座废弃矿坑
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.14,0:27:24.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,可爱的小动物跟炸药呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.75,0:27:27.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,这么精采的节目,怎么会被停播呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.58,0:27:30.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,三个字：太空人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.09,0:27:35.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,太空人一登陆月球,小孩子只想玩太空玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.09,0:27:38.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道那种感觉,我有自己的节目耶
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.76,0:27:41.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们看看这些玩意 - 你不知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.20,0:27:44.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是热门的抢手货耶
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.17,0:27:47.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,真希望我的朋友们能来分享,哇赛,是我耶
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.20,0:27:48.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有溜溜球
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.34,0:27:49.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,(胡迪牛仔秀)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.31,0:27:54.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,洁白的牙齿,帅气依然不减
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.58,0:27:56.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,(孤儿)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.65,0:28:00.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是存钱筒,酷毙了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.22,0:28:03.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么?只要按一下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.22,0:28:06.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,就会吹泡泡,真高明
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.96,0:28:09.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,这玩意是做什么的?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.86,0:28:12.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.63,0:28:14.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的靴子里有蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.90,0:28:19.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,红心,向前跑
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.47,0:28:22.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,一台老唱机
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.01,0:28:27.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我好久没看到这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.31,0:28:29.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,现在慢一点
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.01,0:28:32.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,好好笑哦,红心
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.98,0:28:35.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,上来吧,女牛仔,快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.52,0:28:41.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不错嘛 - 胡迪牛仔秀,大家一起玩
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.22,0:28:43.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是西部
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.69,0:28:46.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,最棒最酷最炫的警长
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.90,0:28:50.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看,我们凑成一整组了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.60,0:28:53.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 现在可以去博物馆了 - 博物馆?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.97,0:28:57.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么博物馆? - 独一无二的博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.04,0:29:02.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们被卖到东京的小西玩具博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.14,0:29:04.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 在日本耶 - 日本?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.41,0:29:07.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行,我不能去日本
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.02,0:29:09.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.52,0:29:11.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得回去找我的主人安弟
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.72,0:29:13.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.26,0:29:16.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他还有主人 - 我的老天
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.99,0:29:19.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我…不要
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.70,0:29:22.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不要回去储藏室
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.73,0:29:24.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 翠丝 - 我不要回到黑暗中
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.87,0:29:26.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,她是怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.80,0:29:29.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们一直被关在储藏室
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.44,0:29:31.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,等你来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.54,0:29:33.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 为什么? - 一定要有你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.44,0:29:36.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,博物馆才肯收藏我们
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.61,0:29:39.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有你,我们就得回储藏室
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.98,0:29:42.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就这么简单 - 不公平
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.72,0:29:44.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么可以这样?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.52,0:29:47.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起,这是个错误
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.59,0:29:50.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我在前院拍卖时被… - 前院拍卖?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.73,0:29:52.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你有主人,怎么会被拍卖?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.00,0:29:55.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是去救一个朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.97,0:29:59.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,是因为你坏了吗?安弟把你弄坏了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.70,0:30:03.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,对,但是…不对!那只是个意外
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.67,0:30:06.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我的意思是... - 听起来他真是爱惜你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.38,0:30:10.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,才不是这样,我也不想去博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.38,0:30:12.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不想回储藏室
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.62,0:30:16.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾而回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.35,0:30:17.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,翠丝,跳进去
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.99,0:30:19.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,翠丝,看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.42,0:30:23.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我保证你一定出得来,快跳进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.13,0:30:32.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,好戏登场了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.37,0:30:36.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,钱来也…钱来也…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.67,0:30:41.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在轮到男主角登场
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.54,0:30:55.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,不!他的手呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.75,0:30:58.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,糟了,不!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.15,0:31:01.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办?我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.92,0:31:05.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,快接…快接电话
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.42,0:31:07.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喂? - 是我艾而
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.32,0:31:08.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有紧急状况
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.39,0:31:10.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我在忙 - 大家都在忙
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.23,0:31:12.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你今晚一定要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.06,0:31:15.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,明天一大早就来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.76,0:31:18.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,完了,天啊,我不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.43,0:31:21.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我的手断了 - 过来让我瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.14,0:31:24.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是线断了,很容易补的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.51,0:31:26.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 算你走运 - 走运?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.94,0:31:29.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是老糊涂吗?我的手断了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.01,0:31:32.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,那又怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.25,0:31:33.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,(嗨,大家好)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.68,0:31:36.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,让他走吧,他的主人这么好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.05,0:31:40.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定很想跟一个,独臂牛仔玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.22,0:31:44.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,翠丝,你知道他这种情况,在外头撑不了一小时
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.49,0:31:48.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,外面的世界对玩具而言,太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.59,0:32:13.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,在我赛好之前别偷看
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.59,0:32:16.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,干得好,走了两条街,剩下十九条街
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.83,0:32:18.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 十九条街?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.23,0:32:20.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,还要多久啊?我快累毙了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.00,0:32:22.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.23,0:32:25.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我被小薛抓走胡迪有放弃吗?没有
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.07,0:32:30.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错,你把他踢下卡车,他有放弃吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.34,0:32:32.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你非得提这档事吗? - 他没有放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.84,0:32:37.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,有一个朋友需要我们,我们一定要把他安全救回家
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.08,0:32:39.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,继续前进
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.75,0:32:48.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天的节目全部播放完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.33,0:33:36.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,红心,走开
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.64,0:33:38.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,别帮我的忙,我是坏人,记得吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.97,0:33:42.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会害你们被收起来,快走开
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.74,0:33:45.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啦,好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.71,0:33:50.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是你不能出声,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.72,0:33:58.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来,好马儿
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.53,0:34:01.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,把我抬起来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.58,0:34:17.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,红心,别乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.01,0:34:20.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,别这样,红心
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.92,0:34:23.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.45,0:34:54.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪牛仔秀,大家一起玩
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.42,0:35:01.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,警察先生,我发誓我没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.80,0:35:11.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,进去吧,好了,烂盒子
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.43,0:35:16.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,电视遥控器呢?遥控器呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.77,0:35:20.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我每次都乱放…在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.99,0:35:33.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,你太卑鄙了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.32,0:35:35.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,很抱歉我帮不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.36,0:35:38.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过你也不必耍这一招
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.13,0:35:40.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说是我干的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.76,0:35:42.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,难道电视会自动打开
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.93,0:35:45.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,遥控器会自己,飞到你面前吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.37,0:35:48.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是说我是骗子吗? - 你是不打自招
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.30,0:35:50.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,再说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.50,0:35:53.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是不打自招
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.91,0:35:56.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,牛仔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.85,0:36:06.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,尝到苦头了吧,把话收回去,收回去
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.19,0:36:08.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,别以为你是女孩子,我就会饶过你
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.76,0:36:11.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,翠丝、胡迪,马上住手
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.49,0:36:12.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,(拿丁字鎚的玩偶他还会说话哟)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.79,0:36:13.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,(胡迪牛仔秀系列玩具)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.56,0:36:16.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道电视怎么会打开
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.96,0:36:19.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过打架没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.30,0:36:22.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 要是我的双手健全… - 你没有双手
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.64,0:36:25.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以你最好等到早上
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.11,0:36:28.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 工匠会来修补你 - 然后我就走人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.08,0:36:34.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,红心,你不要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.32,0:36:36.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 只是安弟… - 安弟…安弟…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.45,0:36:39.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,他只关心安弟
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.66,0:36:50.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,慢一点好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.76,0:36:54.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要提醒你,我可是身怀巨款耶
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.70,0:36:57.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,能量减低,必须休息
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.87,0:37:01.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 大家都到齐了吗? - 还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.11,0:37:03.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谁落后了? - 我的屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.65,0:37:11.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,大伙儿,玩具为什么要过马路?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.29,0:37:14.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 火腿,别闹了 - 我最爱猜迷,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.32,0:37:17.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了到对面的公鸡城
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.19,0:37:19.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,(艾而玩具城)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.59,0:37:21.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,是那只公鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.83,0:37:28.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们已经尽了力 - 我们一定要过马路
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.44,0:37:29.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.77,0:37:31.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不想变成洋芋泥
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.84,0:37:36.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我虽然不聪明,但是我知道马路如虎口
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.21,0:37:38.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定有安全的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.22,0:37:45.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,机会来了,预备,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.66,0:37:56.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,停!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.04,0:38:04.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.84,0:38:08.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,停!我说停!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.54,0:38:11.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.29,0:38:21.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,停
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.30,0:38:30.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.29,0:38:57.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,挺顺利的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.40,0:39:06.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,大伙儿,干得好,就快找到胡迪了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.07,0:39:13.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地,你终于来了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.21,0:39:16.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里有玩具要修理吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.51,0:39:49.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要花多久时间?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.74,0:39:53.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是艺术,急不得
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.72,0:40:04.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,(艾而玩具城)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.79,0:40:07.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,(休息中)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.46,0:40:09.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,糟糕,休息了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.03,0:40:13.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我又不是学龄前玩具,我识字
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.64,0:40:20.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.07,0:40:21.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,快工作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.67,0:40:23.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啦,我来了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.01,0:40:25.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.78,0:40:29.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,可是上面写“休息了”耶
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.42,0:40:34.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,一起来,跳!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.03,0:40:43.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,(击败札克天王必胜秘笈)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.10,0:40:45.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,(想击败札克天王?)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.51,0:40:58.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的妈,地方这么大怎么找呀?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.74,0:41:02.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要找到艾而,就能找到胡迪,出发
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.78,0:41:06.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡迪? - 胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.35,0:42:10.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,(安弟)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.22,0:42:17.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.46,0:42:20.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是展示品
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.73,0:42:23.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,一直玩的话就会坏掉
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.33,0:42:26.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,不可思议,你是个天才,他就像全新的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.40,0:42:27.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,(全新)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.85,0:42:43.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,(太空骑警巴斯光年)
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.15,0:42:50.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇赛
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.13,0:43:03.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,(全新配备)
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.40,0:43:04.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,这玩意我倒是用得上
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.40,0:43:06.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,这玩意我倒是用得上
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.11,0:43:18.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,(太空骑警巴斯光年)
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.28,0:43:21.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定要卖这本书,才能打败札克
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.89,0:43:23.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,这简直是敲诈嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.86,0:43:26.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以为黄金宝杖是用来…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.29,0:43:30.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样找起来比较拉风
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.60,0:43:34.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,干得好,火腿,你没有手指,我来开车
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.54,0:43:46.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真的有这么胖吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.55,0:43:56.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛? - 你直接违反了...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.42,0:43:58.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,你违反了6404.5条规
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.26,0:44:00.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,太空战警一定要留在睡眠舱
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.06,0:44:03.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,等待上级的指令
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.33,0:44:04.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.36,0:44:06.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这是脱队行动
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.43,0:44:09.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年呼叫星际总部
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.17,0:44:12.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这儿有一名逃兵 - 我以前没这么神经吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.90,0:44:16.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,不准顶嘴,我有雷射光,别逼我使用它
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.74,0:44:19.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么雷射,它只是灯泡
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.34,0:44:23.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是脑袋有问题吗?你差点把我害死
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.05,0:44:26.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这个星际叛徒
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.62,0:44:29.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我没时间跟你穷蘑菇 - 停下
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.39,0:44:31.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我命令你站住
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.06,0:44:41.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,听我说,听好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.53,0:44:44.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这条通道走过了 - 才没有
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.47,0:44:47.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这排是粉红色的 - 我们迷路了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.81,0:44:49.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,退后,退后
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.54,0:44:55.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,好棒的派对
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.08,0:44:59.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能弯多低?你能弯多低?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.69,0:45:03.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,美女们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.15,0:45:06.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们知道艾而在哪儿吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.09,0:45:09.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.23,0:45:11.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是导游芭比
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.66,0:45:14.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,请别把头手和配件伸出车外
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.63,0:45:16.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,请别用闪光灯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.54,0:45:19.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 我是有妇之夫…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.67,0:45:22.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就把机会让给单身汉
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.97,0:45:26.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,右手边是模型汽车系列,1967年系列有16辆车
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.18,0:45:28.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,包括雪佛兰跑车
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.81,0:45:30.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起,小姐,请问,艾而的办公室在哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.98,0:45:34.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,请在导览之后再发问,感谢您
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.15,0:45:36.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,上面教你怎么打败札克天王
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.45,0:45:39.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 打扰一下,先生 - 抱抱龙,快拿开
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.32,0:45:42.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 小心! - 停车!停车!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.97,0:45:50.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,方向盘打直
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.40,0:45:54.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的必胜秘笈
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.11,0:45:57.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,回来!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.94,0:46:01.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等我,慢一点
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.68,0:46:04.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,恐龙在后面,慢一点
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.45,0:46:07.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,请留在座位上
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.32,0:46:09.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,[西班牙语]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.06,0:46:13.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,听我说,你不是太空战警
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.93,0:46:16.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是个玩具,我们都是玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.90,0:46:19.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你等着受军法审判吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.63,0:46:23.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,放开我,你搞不懂状况
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.57,0:46:26.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是巴斯光年区
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.34,0:46:31.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,1995那年,巴斯光年玩偶供不应求
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.41,0:46:33.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 巴斯 - 停车,你们是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.91,0:46:36.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,别闹了,上车吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.62,0:46:38.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯 我知道该怎么击败札克
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.92,0:46:42.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗? - 上车后我再告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.25,0:46:47.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,大伙儿,他不是真的巴斯,你们认错人了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.83,0:46:50.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,这么酷的皮带哪来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.20,0:46:52.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,猪扑满,这是标准配备
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.27,0:47:01.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,(西部服饰  牛仔头巾)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.01,0:47:02.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,(和胡迪一起学弹吉他)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.68,0:47:08.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就像在印钞票一样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.28,0:47:10.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,喂,干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.72,0:47:15.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,小西先生,是的,照片都在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.52,0:47:19.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我正开车赶去办公室,准备传真给你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.92,0:47:22.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在过隧道,讯号不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.96,0:47:26.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们看,我真是焕然一新
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.73,0:47:30.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,他缝得好牢,这下安弟一定扯不坏
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.00,0:47:33.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.24,0:47:35.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了,你可以走了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.38,0:47:41.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.22,0:47:52.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,别生翠丝的气
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.86,0:47:55.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,她受的苦也夠多了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.16,0:47:57.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在走之前跟她和好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.73,0:48:00.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是你应该做的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.24,0:48:11.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,不过没什么用
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.15,0:48:20.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在上面干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.72,0:48:25.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想再看太阳一眼,然后就会永远被关起来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.73,0:48:29.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你很恨我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.13,0:48:31.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我一定要回家
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.70,0:48:34.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还是安弟的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.53,0:48:37.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是你认识安弟,一定会了解…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.54,0:48:41.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我猜,他是个特别的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.24,0:48:43.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是他最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.74,0:48:49.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要安弟跟你一起玩,虽然你不会动
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.41,0:48:53.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你却觉得自己是活的,因为他也认为你是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.49,0:48:55.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.75,0:48:59.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为爱咪莉也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.16,0:49:01.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,她是我的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.76,0:49:07.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,当我有人爱
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.87,0:49:11.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切都美好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.17,0:49:14.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,每一分每一秒
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.04,0:49:18.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,都活在我心中
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.18,0:49:22.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,每当她流泪
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.38,0:49:25.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我为她擦干
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.02,0:49:31.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,每当她开心,我也很快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.66,0:49:36.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,当她还爱我
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.80,0:49:43.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管寒冬或酷暑
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.17,0:49:47.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要有彼此,我们不寂莫
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.44,0:49:50.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟她一起
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.54,0:49:55.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,永远相偎依
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.11,0:49:58.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,每当她孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.52,0:50:02.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就陪着她
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.12,0:50:05.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.62,0:50:11.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,她爱我
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.30,0:50:21.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,一年一年过去
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.24,0:50:23.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.94,0:50:27.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,她却越走越远
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.88,0:50:31.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,丢下我一个
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.02,0:50:35.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我仍然期待她
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.12,0:50:37.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,说一声
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.89,0:50:41.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我永远…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.63,0:50:45.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,…都爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.23,0:50:50.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,于是我痴痴的等
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.30,0:50:53.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望她再看一眼
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.84,0:50:57.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,终于她笑着抱着我
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.54,0:51:01.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像美好的从前
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.65,0:51:05.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,她是那么地爱我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.35,0:51:09.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,疼我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.82,0:51:14.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,当我有人爱
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.16,0:51:18.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切都美好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.06,0:51:23.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,每一分每一秒
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.10,0:51:27.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,都活在我心中
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.07,0:51:33.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,当她还爱我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.79,0:51:51.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们忘不了爱咪莉或安弟
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.33,0:51:55.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是他们会忘了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.07,0:51:59.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 翠丝,我不知道 - 你走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.46,0:52:23.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,友情能维持多久?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.23,0:52:26.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真的以为安弟,会带你一起上大学
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.83,0:52:28.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,或是度蜜月吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.67,0:52:32.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟会长大
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.80,0:52:35.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你无法阻止他
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.01,0:52:39.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有两个选择
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.14,0:52:43.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以回去,或是跟我们一起永远保存
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.35,0:52:48.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,受到世世代代小孩的喜爱
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.37,0:53:08.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我算哪根葱,怎么能拆散“胡迪牛仔秀”?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.09,0:53:27.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡迪,你在吗? - 这也是空盒子
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.56,0:53:30.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡迪 胡迪 - 胡迪
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.43,0:53:33.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,打扰了,请问两位,有没有看到断手的牛仔?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.06,0:53:36.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没有耶 - 嘿,他在跟我讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.43,0:53:38.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他是在跟我讲话 - 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.64,0:53:41.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们一直以为
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.70,0:53:44.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,入口是札克城堡的大门
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.44,0:53:49.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实秘密入口在左边,藏在阴影底下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.35,0:53:51.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,左边的阴影下,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.98,0:53:55.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有人来了 - 大家快找掩护
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.99,0:53:58.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,路上大赛车,就甭提了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.52,0:54:00.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,请问你的传真几号?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.89,0:54:02.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.23,0:54:03.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,好多号码哦,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.96,0:54:06.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是他 - 公鸡人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.23,0:54:07.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,奇怪,他一点都不像家禽
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.56,0:54:10.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,他就是绑匪没错
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.40,0:54:13.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,他才不是绑匪,他是札克的爪牙
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.08,0:54:24.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是我的无价之宝
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.01,0:54:27.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我保证这会是,你最耀眼的收藏品
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.85,0:54:30.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那是胡迪 - 这些货你都看了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.35,0:54:33.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要在价钱后面加一个零吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.26,0:54:38.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你要多少钱都行 - 棒呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.33,0:54:41.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,咱们一言为定,我搭下一班机到日本
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.13,0:54:43.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,快跳进家禽人的货舱
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.27,0:54:46.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,他会带我们找到札克,快…快…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.24,0:54:49.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,莎哟娜啦,再见啰
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.31,0:54:58.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,发了!发了!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.20,0:55:58.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,(巴斯光年死敌  札克天王)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.15,0:56:09.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,(看这里)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.39,0:56:12.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,(札克天王远视镜)
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.79,0:56:15.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,消灭巴斯光年
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.03,0:56:19.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,消灭巴斯光年…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.10,0:56:27.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他没拿走袋子 - 不能浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.95,0:56:39.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,他搭乘垂直输送机
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.22,0:56:42.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓紧了,我们要冲到屋顶
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.55,0:56:46.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 巴斯 - 飞向宇宙…浩瀚无垠
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.49,0:56:53.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你秀逗啦?别浪费时间,站好了,抱抱龙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.96,0:56:56.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.20,0:56:58.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的电瓶怎么会没有电
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.39,0:57:18.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,糟了,他到了23楼
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.59,0:57:20.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么上去?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.99,0:57:23.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以找几个气球漂上去
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.53,0:57:26.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了,我们叠罗汉
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.26,0:57:28.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,再按对讲机,假扮我们在送比萨
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.80,0:57:32.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,火腿三明治薯条加热狗,怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.17,0:57:33.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.24,0:57:34.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是随餐附赠玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.07,0:57:37.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,弟兄们,这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.51,0:57:44.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,大蜥蜴,跟你说的一样,入口在左边的阴影下
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.95,0:57:48.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,出动
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.28,0:57:51.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,任务日志,我们潜入敌区
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.72,0:57:54.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,进入札克天王的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.52,0:57:58.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看他是被冲昏了头
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.13,0:58:00.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,糟糕,往哪个方向?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.06,0:58:03.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这边 - 你怎么这么有把握?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.20,0:58:06.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年从不做没把握的事
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.07,0:58:10.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们被发现了,墙壁会把我们夹死
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.11,0:58:12.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,马铃薯快帮我挡一下
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.58,0:58:14.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,笨蛋,快放我下来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.68,0:58:17.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是墙啦,是电梯
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.29,0:58:28.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们来不及了,大伙儿,抓住我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.19,0:58:30.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.26,0:58:33.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,为什么不直接坐电梯?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.26,0:58:35.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,这招会被他们料到
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.13,0:58:41.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,(残障停车位)
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.41,0:58:51.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.98,0:58:54.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,慢一点
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.92,0:58:57.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,六件隔天要送到日本的,快捷包裹要多少钱?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.29,0:59:00.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 是日园吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.59,0:59:01.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 美元? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.06,0:59:06.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在赶时间,你们是故意抢钱耶
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.23,0:59:09.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啦…好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.30,0:59:12.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会在大厅等,你们最好十五分钟后到
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.60,0:59:15.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要赶飞机,听到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.97,0:59:20.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们终于要走了,你相信吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.68,0:59:25.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是特别订做的箱子
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.08,0:59:27.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,这一趟要坐头等舱
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.38,0:59:31.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,老实说,我觉得很兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.19,0:59:33.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.29,0:59:34.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.09,0:59:38.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟着舞伴左摇右晃
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.23,0:59:42.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是个跳舞的牛仔 - 瞧,我在跳方块舞耶
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.34,0:59:55.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,下面小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.24,1:00:00.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 猪肚掉下来了 - 还有多远呀?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.22,1:00:03.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,就快到了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.29,1:00:06.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的手撑不下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.63,1:00:12.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,太重了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.00,1:00:14.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真傻
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.86,1:00:17.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有反重力功能
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.83,1:00:21.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓紧了,我要放手了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.47,1:00:22.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 他不会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.07,1:00:24.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一 - 他会
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.97,1:00:27.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,二,别放手…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.28,1:00:28.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,三!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.81,1:00:36.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞向宇宙…浩瀚无垠
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.02,1:00:40.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,接近目标,恢复重力
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.33,1:00:52.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,安全
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.10,1:00:53.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.17,1:00:58.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,反重力引起的晕眩,马上就会消失,前进吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.21,1:01:01.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,记得提醒我回去以后,要好好教训他一顿
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.19,1:01:13.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,翠丝,介绍我出场吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.19,1:01:16.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要介绍,西部最棒最酷的牛仔
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.53,1:01:17.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,你忘了说最炫
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.93,1:01:22.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,西部最棒最酷,最炫的牛仔英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.87,1:01:24.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪警长
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.74,1:01:37.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,小妞,这儿有麻烦吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.27,1:01:40.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有,胡迪警长会搞定一切
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.20,1:01:42.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,我有了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.27,1:01:44.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,强盗把小动物,关在着火的壳仓
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.77,1:01:46.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,救命呀,壳仓着火了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.98,1:01:49.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来了,别害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.45,1:01:51.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪又解除了危机
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.61,1:01:54.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的爱马红心呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.88,1:01:57.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得潇洒的骑向落日
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.62,1:02:01.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,快马加鞭吧,红心
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.43,1:02:07.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,别这样,我怕痒
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.96,1:02:09.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.87,1:02:12.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,住手,别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.13,1:02:14.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,快住手,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.95,1:02:26.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,任务日志,这是札克的指挥舱
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.68,1:02:29.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有他和木头俘虏的踪影
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.45,1:02:31.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不要! - 那是胡迪
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.82,1:02:34.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.43,1:02:38.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.46,1:02:40.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看得到吗?怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.97,1:02:45.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拿着 - 左边
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.20,1:02:46.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的左边啦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.84,1:02:48.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 高一点 - 怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.97,1:02:52.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,太可怕了,他们在拷问他
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.11,1:02:55.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们该怎么办? - 用用你的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.48,1:02:58.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我不想要用我的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.05,1:03:05.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.52,1:03:07.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,大伙儿,你们怎么找得到我?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.72,1:03:08.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.92,1:03:10.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们来救你了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.56,1:03:12.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,听过无影腿吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.69,1:03:14.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,尝尝我的火腿
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.40,1:03:19.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,见识我愤怒双眼的威力
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.64,1:03:22.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,你们搞错了,他们是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.84,1:03:26.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没错,我们是他的朋友 - 不是啦,我是说他们
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.11,1:03:29.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,站住,笨狗,给我放开他
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.18,1:03:32.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快去救胡迪 - 伙计们,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.28,1:03:34.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 巴斯,放我下来 - 撤退,冲到通风孔
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.82,1:03:37.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他被抢走了 - 不
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.39,1:03:39.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,大伙儿别动
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.86,1:03:41.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 巴斯 - 又是你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.86,1:03:43.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,幸好你没事
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.19,1:03:44.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.73,1:03:48.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,慢着,我是巴斯光年,这里由我指挥
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.40,1:03:49.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我才是巴斯光年
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.87,1:03:51.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我是巴斯光年 - 我才是
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.23,1:03:53.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁是真的巴斯?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.44,1:03:54.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我是! - 我是!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.50,1:03:55.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,别上这个冒牌货的当
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.04,1:03:59.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,札克训练他模仿,我的一举一动
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.28,1:04:06.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,(安弟)
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.42,1:04:07.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.48,1:04:08.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就知道是你
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.02,1:04:12.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是我有时候头尾不分
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.02,1:04:15.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,请你们解释好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.42,1:04:18.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事了,太空战警,这是546密令
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.59,1:04:21.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是说… - 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.30,1:04:23.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他就是… - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.23,1:04:27.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.64,1:04:29.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,你有危险,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.84,1:04:32.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾而要把你卖到,日本的博物馆
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.44,1:04:36.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道,没关系,其实我也想去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.71,1:04:38.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 你疯啦?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.41,1:04:41.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是稀有的胡迪警长玩偶
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.38,1:04:44.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们是我的牛仔秀伙伴
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.32,1:04:47.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么呀? - 胡迪牛仔秀
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.42,1:04:51.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是一个电视节目的明星
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.09,1:04:53.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看,你们看,那是我耶
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.50,1:04:56.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我受不了了 - 我曾经轰动一时
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.07,1:05:00.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还有一大堆周边商品,你们应该瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.50,1:05:03.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,唱机、溜溜球,我曾经是溜溜球耶
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.47,1:05:06.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 曾经? - 别说傻话了,咱们走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.64,1:05:07.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.98,1:05:13.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能丢下这些朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.42,1:05:15.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们需要我才能进博物馆
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.82,1:05:19.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,否则他们就得回去储藏室,永远被关起来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.59,1:05:23.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是收藏品,你是给小孩玩的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.63,1:05:26.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是个玩具
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.23,1:05:29.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还能撑多久?我再被扯破安弟就会抛弃我
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.90,1:05:32.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,到时候我该怎么办?你倒是说啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.33,1:05:35.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我记得你曾经告诉我
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.77,1:05:38.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,当有小孩爱你时生命才有价值
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.91,1:05:42.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我大老远跑来救你
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.48,1:05:44.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我相信你的话
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.48,1:05:48.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你白跑一趟了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.42,1:05:56.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 走吧,大伙儿 - 胡迪呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.19,1:05:59.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不跟来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.53,1:06:03.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,今晚安弟要回家耶
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.80,1:06:06.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我们最好赶回去等他
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.35,1:06:20.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我别无选择,这是我唯一的机会
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.28,1:06:25.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么机会?永远隔着玻璃,看着小孩玩吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.19,1:06:27.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,真可悲
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.76,1:06:34.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 大家都没事吧? - 胡迪警长
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.33,1:06:37.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你救了我们 - 记住了,小朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.90,1:06:40.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,家人和朋友才是你们的一切
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.67,1:06:44.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在走之前,想要跟你们...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.31,1:06:46.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 分享这首歌 - 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.04,1:06:48.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,终于摆脱他们了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.74,1:06:51.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是你好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.15,1:06:53.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是你好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.22,1:06:57.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡迪 - 如果你有麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.22,1:07:00.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.12,1:07:04.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我愿为你赴汤蹈火
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.23,1:07:07.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要团结就能解决
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.20,1:07:10.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我是你好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.43,1:07:16.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许别人比我聪明一点
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.07,1:07:18.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,也比我高大比我强
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.61,1:07:20.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.48,1:07:24.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是从来没有人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.18,1:07:26.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,像我这么爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.08,1:07:28.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.82,1:07:31.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,一年一年过去
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.05,1:07:36.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的友谊更加坚固
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.86,1:07:40.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我这是在干嘛? - 你会发现这是我们的命...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.73,1:07:43.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 巴斯,等等我 - 你要去哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.87,1:07:47.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说得对,安弟一定会长大
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.37,1:07:49.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我不想错过每一刻
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.77,1:07:51.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不! - 巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.97,1:07:53.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 干嘛? - 干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.64,1:07:55.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要跟你们走
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.11,1:07:58.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下,我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.38,1:08:00.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,干得好,牛仔
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.45,1:08:04.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 大伙儿,跟我一起来吧 - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.09,1:08:06.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟会跟我们一起玩
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.32,1:08:08.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,我不晓得耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.49,1:08:12.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,难道你不想再陪伴爱咪莉吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.23,1:08:16.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,翠丝,最重要的是,让一个小孩快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.67,1:08:19.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你心里很明白,红心,你来不来?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.84,1:08:22.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,好马儿
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.84,1:08:24.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,老矿工,你说呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.84,1:08:31.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 老矿工? - 你离开盒子了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.85,1:08:35.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我试着跟你讲道理
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.18,1:08:38.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是你逼得我不择手段
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.36,1:08:43.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,昨晚是你打开电视,不是翠丝
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.89,1:08:47.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要永远一起留在博物馆
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.53,1:08:50.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不要破坏咱们之间的感情
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.33,1:08:52.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真的很可恶耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.57,1:08:53.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,老矿工,这样很不公平
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.04,1:08:57.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,不公平?什么叫不公平?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.64,1:09:03.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我一辈子都坐在架子上,看着别的玩具被卖走
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.21,1:09:05.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在我终于熬出头
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.51,1:09:10.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个臭牛仔,休想坏了我的好事
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.22,1:09:14.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,救命呀,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.96,1:09:19.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,太迟了,那个撒隆巴斯帮不了你
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.13,1:09:21.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的名字是巴斯光年
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.43,1:09:25.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,随便啦,我最讨厌太空玩具了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.77,1:09:28.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡住了,怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.24,1:09:30.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,要用我脑袋吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.01,1:09:33.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,是艾而
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.24,1:09:37.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我快赶不及了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.91,1:09:40.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能错过班机,我得打包
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.15,1:09:42.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,钱包、钥匙、机票
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.45,1:09:45.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,护照、牛肉干…在日本很贵
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.42,1:09:48.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,洗澡,来不及洗了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.19,1:09:52.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得走了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.23,1:09:54.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,快去坐电梯
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.30,1:10:01.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点,电梯来了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.78,1:10:09.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年,我们又见面了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.78,1:10:11.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,这次你死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.48,1:10:15.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,是札克天王,小心,他有离子炮
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.56,1:10:32.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,快上电梯
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.64,1:10:37.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,紧急逃生口,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.83,1:11:01.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 来吧,快点 - 巴斯有危险耶
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.30,1:11:04.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年…拯救世界
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.01,1:11:17.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,投降吧,巴斯光年,我赢了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.95,1:11:20.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会投降,你杀了我父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.92,1:11:25.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,巴斯,我就是你父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.19,1:11:28.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.06,1:11:32.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点…快点…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.83,1:11:39.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,你可以打败札克
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.80,1:11:42.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只要相信自己
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.80,1:11:46.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 领死吧 - 我不敢看
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.38,1:11:58.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我成功了,我终于打败札克了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.42,1:11:59.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.16,1:12:09.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,终于到了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.25,1:12:36.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么救他?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.16,1:12:38.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁要吃比萨?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.89,1:12:40.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,(比萨星球)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.16,1:12:42.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快走,快走 - 我接到了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.20,1:12:43.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,你来不来?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.33,1:12:47.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,不了,我要多陪陪我爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.37,1:12:52.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,丢得好,乖儿子,跑远一点,小巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.47,1:12:56.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是个好爸爸,万岁 - 再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.44,1:12:58.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人会开车吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.28,1:13:00.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹簧狗,踩油门,抱抱龙,看方向
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.68,1:13:03.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,火腿和蛋头,控制按键
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.29,1:13:10.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 陌生人 - 外面来的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.12,1:13:13.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 惨了 - 是红灯,快追上去
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.36,1:13:14.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹簧狗,全速前进
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.86,1:13:19.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,绿灯了,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.30,1:13:21.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 为什么不动? - 你们要用动力棍
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.11,1:13:32.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 抱抱龙,往哪儿? - 左,我是说右
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.51,1:13:35.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,对了,左边才对
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.58,1:13:40.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,他左转了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.69,1:13:42.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.02,1:13:47.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,这辆车吃油吃得很凶
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.63,1:13:50.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,右转!右转!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.83,1:13:57.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你救了我们,我们永远感谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.54,1:13:59.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啦,随便啦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.61,1:14:03.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,(国际机场)
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.25,1:14:11.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,白线只准卸货或上下乘客
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.42,1:14:14.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,不准停车
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.49,1:14:16.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,(远东航空)
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.56,1:14:19.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,不能停这儿,这是白线
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.19,1:14:22.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,你救了我们,我们永远感谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.26,1:14:24.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 最后登机电话... - 他在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.23,1:14:26.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,前往东京的班机马上起飞
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.93,1:14:31.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,已登记的旅客请马上登机
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.14,1:14:36.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,旅客托维奇,请和地勤人员联络…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.14,1:14:38.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,你救了我们,我们永远感谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.98,1:14:41.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别缠着我,好吗? - 有人来了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.55,1:14:44.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 小狗狗 - 汪汪汪...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.28,1:14:46.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,汪汪汪…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.85,1:14:47.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我听好,小飞仔
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.92,1:14:50.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,箱子里的东西你赔不起
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.92,1:14:53.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 瞭不瞭? 小心点 - 我明白
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.39,1:14:55.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,给我小心点,没有“易碎”的标签吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.83,1:14:58.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我带过一盒饼干,结果变成饼干屑
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.67,1:15:01.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,神奇的入口
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.73,1:15:06.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们进去后,只要找到箱子就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.02,1:15:23.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 箱子在那儿 - 是那个箱子
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.39,1:15:26.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你去追那个,我们追这个
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.13,1:15:33.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,(屁屁)
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.14,1:15:43.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,我的尾巴要往德州去了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.04,1:15:45.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹簧狗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.65,1:15:50.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,我们来了,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.45,1:15:52.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,好炫的闪光灯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.66,1:16:08.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.70,1:16:11.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,吃我一拳,太空玩具
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.47,1:16:14.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不能打我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.61,1:16:22.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我警告你
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.68,1:16:25.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你再不乖乖合作,我就把你拆了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.55,1:16:28.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,他一样能把你补好,给我进去
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.06,1:16:31.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.70,1:16:39.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 逮到你了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.77,1:16:42.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,白痴,小孩子会毁了玩具
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.30,1:16:44.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们会被玩坏、遗忘
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.74,1:16:47.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,永远被埋在垃圾场
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.64,1:16:52.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,邋遢彼得,你该学会怎么跟小孩玩了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.91,1:16:57.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 把他放到那儿 - 不!不!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.25,1:17:02.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,大西洋航空810号班机
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.09,1:17:04.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,抵达三号登机门
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.09,1:17:07.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,芭比,你看,好丑的老娃娃
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.09,1:17:08.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,(芭比)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.23,1:17:09.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要帮他整容
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.86,1:17:15.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨,你会喜欢艾美
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.37,1:17:17.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,她是天才艺术家
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.07,1:17:22.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧,乖乖
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.14,1:17:26.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,祝你幸福,老矿工
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.21,1:17:28.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 巴斯、胡迪 - 帮帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.95,1:17:30.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.12,1:17:33.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 糟了,翠丝,快点 - 救命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.63,1:17:44.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,翠丝
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.80,1:17:47.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,上来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.30,1:17:49.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,快马加鞭吧,红心
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.85,1:18:01.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点,马儿
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.81,1:18:04.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,跑快点,红心
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.49,1:18:09.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,把我抬起来
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.10,1:18:19.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.43,1:18:20.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,(远东航空)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.96,1:18:45.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,(远东航空)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.07,1:18:54.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,只剩下这些了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.52,1:19:18.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,小姐,你搭错班机了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.82,1:19:20.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 胡迪 - 来吧,翠丝
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.93,1:19:22.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我带你回家
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.76,1:19:25.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 要是安弟不喜欢我怎么办? - 别傻了,他会喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.07,1:19:29.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 而且他有个小妹妹 - 真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.40,1:19:32.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么不早说?快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.64,1:19:39.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,还有几件行李没到
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.41,1:19:41.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我数到三
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.41,1:19:43.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 一、二… - 太迟了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.78,1:19:46.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,等下一班机吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.16,1:19:55.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这下可糟了 - 我们该怎么出去?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.30,1:19:59.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.58,1:20:15.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你确定吗? - 不!来吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.32,1:20:20.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,(调准水平)
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.94,1:20:37.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓紧了,胡迪
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.24,1:20:45.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 牛仔没有牛仔帽怎么行? - 巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.43,1:21:02.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,到轮胎后面
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.60,1:21:09.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,翠丝,放手
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.97,1:21:11.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你疯啦?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.40,1:21:14.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,假装这是“胡迪牛仔秀”大结局
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.57,1:21:18.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,它被停播了,你不知道结局
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.14,1:21:20.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在一起演吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.69,1:21:37.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,成功了!成功了!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.23,1:21:38.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,干得好,牛仔
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.80,1:21:41.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是胡迪最光荣的一刻
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.70,1:21:44.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的帽子,伙伴
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.01,1:21:52.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,咱们回家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.13,1:22:10.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪,胡迪?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.03,1:22:14.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,(安弟,欢迎回家)
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.57,1:22:18.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,新玩具,酷毙了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.80,1:22:20.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢了,妈咪
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.67,1:22:25.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,火箭炮珍妮和她的喷射马
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.01,1:22:29.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡迪、巴斯,札克偷走我的太空牛
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.38,1:22:32.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们飞到陨石带了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.39,1:22:40.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟,该走了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.06,1:22:43.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你把胡迪补好了 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.86,1:22:47.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,幸好我没带他去牛仔营,要不然他整只手都会被扯断
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.67,1:22:55.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,真没想到
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.88,1:23:02.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,红心,我们又有新的家了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.98,1:23:05.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,(弟安)
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.28,1:23:06.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,(安弟)
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.59,1:23:09.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,小姐,我想告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.19,1:23:11.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是个毛线飘逸的…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.39,1:23:13.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,…漂亮姑娘
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.33,1:23:16.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说秀发飘逸
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.23,1:23:17.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得走了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.43,1:23:21.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我见过,最可爱的太空玩具
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.80,1:23:25.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么事?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.00,1:23:29.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,小狗狗得到后院方便一下
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.44,1:23:31.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,那只狗需要帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.16,1:23:45.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱抱龙,帮帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.26,1:23:48.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不必玩了,我亲手打败过札克
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.73,1:23:50.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,惨了惨了,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.73,1:23:52.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临艾而玩具城
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.97,1:23:55.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的价格最便宜
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.90,1:24:00.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,每样玩具都一块钱
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.34,1:24:03.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,犯罪没有好下场
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.81,1:24:07.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,安弟把我缝得好结实
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.18,1:24:10.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢,你很强壮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.92,1:24:15.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你救了我们,我们永远感谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.42,1:24:19.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,你救了他们?喔,我的英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.36,1:24:22.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们好可爱,我们领养他们吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.90,1:24:24.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.23,1:24:25.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.70,1:24:29.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,吱吱,你被修好了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.07,1:24:33.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,鲨鱼先生找到一个吱吱盒
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.51,1:24:36.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你觉得怎样? - 好得不得了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.81,1:24:41.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想要为大家献唱一曲
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.18,1:24:46.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是你好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.72,1:24:51.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是你好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.59,1:24:54.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,紧紧记住这句话
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.39,1:24:57.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是你好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.00,1:25:00.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是你好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.93,1:25:04.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,妹妹,你越长越高啰
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.44,1:25:06.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看她可以开车了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.64,1:25:08.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以啊,我来教她
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.57,1:25:11.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你还在担心? - 担心安弟?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.54,1:25:15.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 才不,好时光要珍惜 - 我以你为傲,牛仔
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.91,1:25:21.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,就算安弟长大了,巴斯光年还是我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.12,1:25:23.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,一同飞向宇宙…直到永远
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.09,1:25:24.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,一同飞向宇宙…直到永远
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.46,1:25:28.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是上天注定的命运
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.03,1:25:30.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我是你好朋友 - 一点也没错
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.90,1:25:33.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我是你好朋友 - 一点也没错
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.43,1:25:36.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我是你好朋友 - 说得好
